msgid "Enabling a text editor for a text format"
msgstr ""
"የጽሑፍ ቅርጸ-ቅጥ (text format) ለመጠቀም "
"የጽሑፍ አርታዒ እንዲነቃ ማድረግ"

msgid "Configuring a text editor"
