msgstr ""
"%entity_type: ሁሉንም የአቀማመጥ ማስተካከያዎች "
"ይቀናብሩ"

msgid ""
"%entity_type: Configure layout overrides for @entity_type_plural that "
"the user can edit"
msgstr ""
"%entity_type: ተጠቃሚው ሊያርት የሚችል "
