"This theme is not compatible with Drupal @core_version. Check that the "
".info.yml file contains a compatible 'core' or "
"'core_version_requirement' value."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ገጽታ (theme) ከ Drupal @core_version ጋር ተኳሃኝ "
