"(content type) ላይ መስክ ለመጨመር ከ<em>Manage</em> "
"የአስተዳዳሪ (administrative) ምናሌ ውስጥ "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; @content_types_link ይሂዱ።"

msgid ""
