"For more information read the <a href=\":url\">documentation on "
"deprecated modules.</a>"
msgstr ""
"ተጨማሪ መረጃ ለማግኘት <a "
"href=\":url\">የተቋረጡ ሞጁሎች ላይ ያለውን "
"ሰነድ</a> ይመልከቱ።"

msgid ""
"For more information read the <a href=\":url\">documentation on "
