"Learn about <a href=\":twig_href\">Twig</a> and how it is used in <a "
"href=\":drupal_href\">Drupal</a>."
msgstr ""
"በ <a href=\":twig_href\">Twig</a> ላይ እና በ <a "
"href=\":drupal_href\">Drupal</a> ውስጥ እንዴት "
"እንደሚጠቀምበት ይማሩ።"

