"<a href=\":href_webform\">Antibot protection</a> is enabled for all "
"webforms."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":href_webform\">በድረ-ገጽ ተከላካይ (Antibot) "
"</a> ጥበቃ ለሁሉም የድረ-ገጽ ቅጾች "
"ተንቅቷል።"

