msgid "<a href=\":hoverintent_src_url\" target=\"_blank\">hoverIntent</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\":hoverintent_src_url\" target=\"_blank\">hoverIntent</a>"

msgid ""
"The features of the <em>Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter</em> module "
"are included in Drupal core since version 10.3 and therefore "
"<strong>it should be uninstalled</strong>.<br>Since the module is no "
"longer needed, it <em>will</em> be removed in future releases of "
"<em>Admin Toolbar</em> when support for versions lower than 10.3 is "
"dropped.<br>\n"
"See issues: <a href=\":issue_url1\">#3463291</a> and <a "
"href=\":issue_url2\">#3487246</a>."
msgstr ""
"<em>የአስተዳዳሪ መሣሪያ አሞሌ ሊንኮች "
"መዳረሻ ማጣሪያ</em> ሞጁሉ የሚያቀርባቸው "
"ባህሪዎች በDrupal ኮር ውስጥ ከስሪት 10.3 ጀምሮ "
"ተካትተዋል፣ ስለዚህ <strong>መጥፋት (uninstall) "
"አለበት</strong>።<br>ይህ ሞጁል ከአሁን በኋላ "
"አያስፈልግም ስለሆነ፣ <em>በመጪው "
"እትሞች</em> ውስጥ <em>Admin Toolbar</em> ውስጥ "
"እናቀርበዋለን የ10.3 ከላይ ያልሆኑ ስሪቶች "
"ድጋፍ ሲቋረጥ በፊት ማስወገዱ "
"<em>ይከሰታል</em>።<br>\n"
"ጉዳዮችን ይመልከቱ፦ "
"<a href=\":issue_url1\">#3463291</a> እና <a "
"href=\":issue_url2\">#3487246</a>።"

msgid ""
"If set, the search input will be focused when the user presses the "
"keys: \"Alt + a\".<br>Disable this setting if it conflicts with any "
"existing keyboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ተስተካክሏ ከሆነ፣ ተጠቃሚው ቁልፎቹን "
"“Alt + a” ሲጫን የፍለጋ ግቤቱ ትኩረት (focus) "
"ይደረጋል።<br>ከማንኛውም ያለ የቁልፍ "
"ማቀናበር ጋር ከተጋጭ ካለ ይህን ቅንብር "
"ያሰናክሉ።"

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar module provides a better user experience for the "
"default Drupal Toolbar.<br>It is a drop-down menu that allows quicker "
"access to all the administration pages in a more efficient way, with "
"fewer clicks and less scrolling.<br><br>The following settings mostly "
"provide advanced configuration of the JavaScript behavior of the "
"Toolbar sticky and hoverIntent."
msgstr ""
"የ Admin Toolbar ሞጁሉ ለነባሩ የ Drupal Toolbar "
"የተሻለ ተጠቃሚ ልምድ ይሰጣል።<br>እሱ "
"ሁሉንም የአስተዳደር ገጾች በተሻለ አድርጎ "
"ለመድረስ ፈጣን መዳረሻ የሚሰጥ የመውረጃ "
"ምናሌ ነው፤ በትንሽ ጠቅታዎች እና በያነሰ "
"መገልበጥ ያስችላል።<br><br>የሚከተሉት "
"ቅንብሮች አብዛኛውን ጊዜ የ Toolbar sticky እና "
"hoverIntent የጃቫስክሪፕት ባህሪን "
"ለማስተካከል የላቀ ውቅር ይሰጣሉ።"

msgid ""
"By default, the Admin Toolbar sticky behavior is <em>enabled</em> so "
"it stays at the top of the browser window when scrolling up or "
"down.<br>Select <em>Disabled</em> to disable Admin Toolbar's sticky "
"behavior so it stays at the top of the page when scrolling up/down and "
"does not follow the browser window."
msgstr ""
"በነባሪ (default) የአስተዳዳሪ ባር (Admin Toolbar) "
"ስቲኪ (sticky) ባህሪ <em>ንቁ</em> ነው፣ ስለዚህ "
"ላይ ወይም ታች ሲያሸብልሉ የብሮውዘር "
"መስኮቱ ግርጌ/ላይ ላይ እንዲቆይ "
"ያደርጋል።<br>አስተዳዳሪ ባር ስቲኪ ባህሪን "
"ለማሰናከል (disable) እና ከላይ ወደ ታች "
"ሲያሸብልሉ ገጹ ላይ ብቻ እንዲቆይ እና "
"ከብሮውዘር መስኮት ጋር እንዳይከተል "
"ለማድረግ <em>Disabled</em> ይምረጡ።"

msgid ""
"If set, the toolbar will be hidden or visible when the user presses "
"the keys: \"Alt + p\".<br>Disable this setting if it conflicts with "
"any existing keyboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ከተዘጋጀ ተጠቃሚው ቁልፎቹን “Alt + p” "
"ሲጫን መሣሪያ አሞሌው ይደበቅ ወይም ይታይ "
"ይሆናል።<br>ከማንኛውም ነባር የቁልፍ "
"ማዋቀር ጋር ግጭት ካለ ይህን ማስተካከያ "
"አቦዝን (disable)።"

msgid ""
"Provides a smoother user experience, where only menu items which are "
"paused over are expanded, to avoid accidental activations.<br>Disable "
"@hoverintent_source_link to use module's default basic JavaScript "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"ተጠቃሚው ልምድ የተሻለ ይሆናል፤ ላይ "
"የሚያርፉ (hover) የምናሌ እቃዎች ብቻ "
"እንዲዘረጉ ተደርጎ ስለሚሆን በአጋጣሚ "
"መንካት/መንቀሳቀስ እንዳይከሰት "
"ይከላከላል።<br>@hoverintent_source_link ን አቦዝን "
"በማድረግ የሞጁሉን ነባሪ (default) መሠረታዊ "
"JavaScript ባህሪ ለመጠቀም ይችላሉ።"

msgid ""
"Sets the hoverIntent trigger timeout (steps of 250).<br>The higher the "
"value, the longer the menu dropdown stays visible, after the mouse "
"moves out (default: 500ms)."
msgstr ""
"HoverIntent ማስነሻ (trigger) ጊዜውን ያቀናብሩ "
"(በ250 እርምጃዎች)።<br>ዋጋው ከፍ በሆነ መጠን "
"መዳፊቱ ከተንቀሳቀሰ በኋላ የምናሌው "
"ተደራሽ ወረቀት (menu dropdown) ለብዙ ጊዜ ታይቶ "
"ይቆያል (ነባሪ፦ 500ms)።"

msgid "CKEditor Anchor Link"
msgstr "CKEditor የመስቀል ሊንክ"

msgid "CKEditor Web link"
msgstr "CKEditor ዌብ አገናኝ"

msgid ""
"This plugin module adds the better link dialog and anchor related "
"features to CKEditor in Drupal 9"
msgstr ""
"ይህ ፕለጊን ሞጁል በ Drupal 9 ውስጥ በ CKEditor "
"ላይ የተሻለ ሊንክ ዳይሎግ እና አንከር "
"የተዛመዱ ባህሪዎችን ይጨምራል።"

msgid "#@anchor_link"
msgstr "#@anchor_link"

msgid "Anchor links (within the same page)"
msgstr ""
"ከማንኛውም ገጽ ውስጥ ያሉ አንክር ሊንኮች "
"(በተመሳሳይ ገጽ ውስጥ)"

msgid "CKEditor Anchor link"
msgstr "CKEditor አንከር ሊንክ"

msgid "Add a note to the backup"
msgstr "የመጠባበቂያው ላይ ማስታወሻ ጨምር"

msgid "was due @time ago"
msgstr "ከ@time በፊት ነበር"

msgid "Created the %label Settings Profile."
msgstr "%label የቅንብር መገለጫ (Settings Profile) ፈጠረ።"

msgid "Saved the %label Settings Profile."
msgstr "የ%label ቅንብሮች መገለጫውን አስቀምጠዋል።"

msgid "Label for the Backup Source."
msgstr "د बैকアップ ምንጭ መለያ (Label)."

msgid ""
"%title must contain only letters, numbers, dashes (-) and underscores "
"(_). And Site Tokens."
msgstr ""
"%title ውስጥ ፊደሎች፣ ቁጥሮች፣ ዳሾች (-) እና "
"መስመር መለያዎች (_) ብቻ እንዲሁም የጣቢያ "
"ቶከኖች (Site Tokens) መካተት አለበት።"

msgid "Use <a href=\"http://php.net/date\">PHP Date formatting</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"http://php.net/date\">PHP የቀን አቀራረብ</a> "
"ይጠቀሙ።"

msgid "Label for the Backup Destination."
msgstr "ለባックአፕ መድረሻ መለያ (ሊብል)"

msgid ""
"The number of backups to retain. Once this number is reached, the "
"oldest backup will be deleted to make room for the most recent backup. "
"Leave blank to keep all backups."
msgstr ""
"ማቆያ ሊኖሩ የሚገባቸው የባክአፕ ብዛት። "
"ይህ ቁጥር ሲደርስ፣ በጣም ጥንታዊው "
"ባክአፕ ለቅርቡ ባክአፕ ቦታ ለመፍጠር "
"ይሰረዛል። ሁሉንም ባክአፕ ለመቆየት ባዶ "
"ይተዉ።"

msgid ""
"In order to encrypt backup files, please install the Defuse "
"PHP-encryption library via Composer with the following command: "
"<code>composer require defuse/php-encryption</code>. See the <a "
"href=\"@docs\">Defuse PHP Encryption Documentation Page</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"የመጠባበቂያ ፋይሎችን ለመመስጠር እባክዎ "
"በComposer በመጠቀም የDefuse PHP-encryption "
"ቤተ-መጽሐፍትን በሚከተለው ትእዛዝ ይጫኑ፦ "
"<code>composer require defuse/php-encryption</code>. ለበለጠ "
"መረጃ የ<a href=\"@docs\">Defuse PHP Encryption ሰነድ "
"ገጽ</a>ን ይመልከቱ።"

msgid "All backups"
msgstr "ሁሉም የተቀመጡ ቅጂዎች"

msgid "Restore completed at @time"
msgstr "ከ@time ጀምሮ ማጠናቀቅ ተመልሷል።"

msgid "Schedules Tab"
msgstr "የቀጠሮዎች ትር"

msgid "Download Backup"
msgstr "የመጠባበቂያ (Backup) ያውርዱ"

msgid "Choose the backup source."
msgstr "የመጠባበቂያ (backup) ምንጭን ይምረጡ።"

msgid "Choose the backup settings profile."
msgstr ""
"የመጠባበቂያ (backup) ቅንብሮች መገለጫውን "
"ይምረጡ።"

msgid "Choose the destination."
msgstr "የመድረሻውን ይምረጡ።"

msgid "Choose the schedule backup you want to run."
msgstr ""
"ඔබ ක්‍රියාත්මක කිරීමට "
"කැමති උපස්ථ උපලේඛනය (backup "
"schedule) තෝරන්න."

msgid "Backup finished with failure"
msgstr ""
"ማስታወሻ (Backup) ሂደቱ በስኬት "
"አልተጠናቀቀም።"

msgid "Exception Message: "
msgstr "የልዩ ሁኔታ መልዕክት፡"

msgid ""
"The Backup Destination \"Download\" does not support taking the site "
"offline during backup."
msgstr ""
"“Backup Destination” ላይ ያለው “Download” "
"የተባለው ምትክ ሲደረግ በሳይቱ ላይ offline "
"ሁኔታ ማድረግን አይደግፍም።"

msgid ""
"Keep CAPTCHA related counters in the <a href=\":statusreport\">status "
"report</a>. Note that this comes with a performance penalty as "
"updating the counters results in clearing the variable cache."
msgstr ""
"CAPTCHA ከተያያዙ ቆጣሪዎችን በ <a "
"href=\":statusreport\">የሁኔታ ሪፖርቱ</a> ውስጥ "
"ያቆዩ። ይህ ሲደረግ የአፈጻጸም ቅነሳ "
"(performance penalty) እንደሚኖር "
"ያስታውሱ—ቆጣሪዎቹን ሲያዘምኑ ተለዋዋጭ "
"(variable) ካቼ (cache) መጥፋትን/መታደስ "
"ያስከትላል።"

msgid ""
"Note that the CAPTCHA module interacts with page caching (see <a "
"href=\":performancesettings\">performance settings</a>). Because the "
"challenge should be unique for each generated form, the caching of the "
"page it appears on is prevented. Make sure that these forms do not "
"appear on too many pages or you will lose much caching efficiency. For "
"example, if you put a CAPTCHA on the user login block, which typically "
"appears on each page for anonymous visitors, caching will practically "
"be disabled. The comment submission forms are another example. In this "
"case you should set the <em>Location of comment submission form</em> "
"to <em>Display on separate page</em> in the comment settings of the "
"relevant <a href=\":contenttypes\">content types</a> for better "
"caching efficiency."
msgstr ""
"እባክዎ ይህን ያስተውሉ፦ CAPTCHA ሞጁሉ የገጽ "
"መሸጎጫ (page caching) ጋር እንደሚገናኝ "
"አስታውስ ( <a href=\":performancesettings\">የአፈጻጸም "
"ቅንብሮች</a> ይመልከቱ )። ፈተናው "
"ለእያንዳንዱ የተፈጠረ ቅጽ ልዩ መሆን "
"አለበት በመሆኑ፣ በሚታይበት ገጹ "
"የሚደረገው መሸጎጫ ይከለከላል። እነዚህ "
"ቅጾች በጣም ብዙ ገጾች ላይ እንዳይታዩ "
"ያረጋግጡ፣ ካለበለዚያ የመሸጎጫ "
"ውጤታማነት ብዙ ይቀንሳል። ለምሳሌ የ CAPTCHA "
"ን የተጠቃሚ መግቢያ (user login) ብሎክ ላይ "
"ካስቀመጡት—ይህ ብዙ ጊዜ ለተባረሩ "
"አጠቃላይ ጎብኝዎች በእያንዳንዱ ገጽ ላይ "
"ይታያል—የመሸጎጫው በተግባር ሊበራ "
"አይችልም (practically be disabled)። የኮመንት "
"ማስገቢያ ቅጾችም ሌላ ምሳሌ ናቸው። በዚህ "
"ሁኔታ ለተሻለ የመሸጎጫ ውጤታማነት "
"በተዛማጅ  <a href=\":contenttypes\">content types</a> "
"የኮመንት ቅንብሮች ውስጥ ያለውን "
"<em>የኮመንት ማስገቢያ ቅጽ መገኛ</em> ወደ "
"<em>በተለየ ገጽ ላይ አሳይ</em> ማቀናበር "
"ይገባዎታል።"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Skip CAPTCHA</em> <a href=\":perm\">permission</a> "
"won't be offered a challenge. Be sure to grant this permission to the "
"trusted users (e.g. site administrators). If you want to test a "
"protected form, be sure to do it as a user without the <em>Skip "
"CAPTCHA</em> permission (e.g. as anonymous user)."
msgstr ""
"የ<em>CAPTCHAን መዝለል</em> <a href=\":perm\">ፍቃድ</a> "
"ያላቸው ተጠቃሚዎች ፈተና (challenge) "
"አይቀርባቸውም። ይህን ፍቃድ ለታመኑ "
"ተጠቃሚዎች እንዲሰጥ ያረጋግጡ (ለምሳሌ "
"የጣቢያ አስተዳዳሪዎች)። ከተጠበቀ ፎርም "
"ላይ ለመሞከር ከፈለጉ፣ እባክዎ እንደ "
"<em>CAPTCHAን መዝለል</em> ፍቃድ የሌለው ተጠቃሚ "
"(ለምሳሌ እንግዳ/anonymous ተጠቃሚ) ሆነው "
"ያድርጉት።"

msgid ""
"CAPTCHA session reuse attack detected on @form_id <br/>Posted CAPTCHA "
"token: @posted_captcha_token <br/>Expected captcha token: "
"@expected_captcha_token"
msgstr ""
"የCAPTCHA ሴሽን ዳግም-መጠቀም ጥቃት ተገኝቷል "
"በ @form_id <br/>ለጫነው የCAPTCHA ቶከን፦ "
"@posted_captcha_token <br/>የተጠበቀ የCAPTCHA ቶከን፦ "
"@expected_captcha_token"

msgid ""
"%form_id post blocked by CAPTCHA module: challenge %challenge (by "
"module %module)."
msgstr ""
"%form_id የ CAPTCHA ሞጁል ተጠቃሚ ፈተና (challenge) "
"ምክንያት ተከልክሏል፤ %challenge (በ %module "
"ሞጁል)።"

msgid ""
"Configurable error message that the user gets when it enters an "
"incorrect CAPTCHA answer."
msgstr ""
"ተጠቃሚው የተሳሳተ CAPTCHA መልስ ሲያስገባ "
"የሚያገኘው ሊቀየር የሚችል የስህተት "
"መልዕክት።"

msgid ""
"Lower and upper IP addresses should be different. Please correct range "
"%ip_range."
msgstr ""
"ዝቅተኛና ከፍተኛ የIP አድራሻዎች መለያየት "
"ሊኖርባቸው ይገባል። እባክዎ የ%ip_range "
"ክልልን ያስተካክሉ።"

msgid ""
"A CAPTCHA can be added to virtually any Drupal form, through adding an "
"affiliated <em>CAPTCHA Point</em>. Some default <em>CAPTCHA "
"Points</em> are already provided in the <em>CAPTCHA Point</em> "
"section, but arbitrary forms can be easily added and managed."
msgstr ""
"CAPTCHA ን በመሠረቱ ወደ ማንኛውም የDrupal ፎርም "
"ሊጨምር ይችላል፣ በ<em>CAPTCHA Point</em> ተዛማጅ "
"አካል በመጨመር ብቻ። በ<em>CAPTCHA Point</em> "
"ክፍል ውስጥ አንዳንድ ነባር <em>CAPTCHA Points</em> "
"ቀድሞውኑ ተዘጋጅተው አሉ፣ ነገር ግን "
"የሚፈልጉትን ልዩ ፎርሞች በቀላሉ ማከል "
"እና መቆጣጠር ይቻላል።"

msgid ""
"Enter one IP-address per row in the format XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX. "
"Alternatively you can also define IP-address ranges per row in the "
"format XXX.XXX.XXX.YYY-XXX.XXX.XXX.ZZZ. No spaces allowed. Your "
"current IP address is %ip_address."
msgstr ""
"ከሚያስፈልጉት በአንድ ረድ (row) አንድ አይፒ "
"አድራሻ በመጻፍ XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX ቅርጸ-ቁጥር "
"ይጠቀሙ። በአማራጭ ሁኔታ ለእያንዳንዱ ረድ "
"የአይፒ አድራሻ ክልሎችንም መግለጽ "
"ይችላሉ፣ ቅርጸ-ቁጥሩ XXX.XXX.XXX.YYY-XXX.XXX.XXX.ZZZ "
"ነው። ምንም ቦታ (spaces) መኖር የለበትም። "
"አሁን ያለዎት አይፒ አድራሻ %ip_address ነው።"

msgid "Reload Captcha"
msgstr "Captcha እንደገና አስገምግሙ"

msgid "Overlay close"
msgstr "ኦቨርሌይ መዝጊያ"

msgid "Custom (with tokens)"
msgstr "ብጁ (ቶከኖችን ከተጠቃሚ ጋር)"

msgid ""
"For token support the <a href=\"@token_url\">token module</a> must be "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"ቶከን ድጋፍ (token support) እንዲኖር የ <a "
"href=\"@token_url\">token module</a> መጫን አለበት።"

msgid "Plain (mainly for images)"
msgstr "ቀላል (በተፈጥሮ ለምስሎች የሚሆን)"

msgid "Enable closing Colorbox by clicking on the background overlay."
msgstr ""
"ከትኩስ ማያ ንጣፍ (background overlay) ላይ በመጫን "
"የColorbox መዝጋትን እንዲቻል አንቃ።"

msgid ""
"If the Colorbox should be displayed in a fixed position within the "
"visitor's viewport or relative to the document."
msgstr ""
"Colorbox ን የጎብኚው መመልከቻ መስኮት (viewport) "
"ውስጥ በቋሚ ቦታ ወይም ከሰነዱ ጋር ተያይዞ "
"መታየት አለበት?"

msgid "Mobile detection"
msgstr "ሞባይል መለየት"

msgid "Content image style of first image: @style"
msgstr ""
"دርምሳዊ ምስል የመጀመሪያው ምስል የይዘት "
"ምስል አቀማመጥ፦ @style"

msgid "Node style first"
msgstr "Նሬድቲ ስታይል ከመጀመር ቀድሞ"

msgid "Colorbox is already present at @path. No download required."
msgstr ""
"Colorbox አሁንም በ @path ውስጥ አለ። ምንም "
"ဒౌንሎድ አያስፈልግም።"

msgid ""
"Drush was unable to download the colorbox library from @remote. "
"@exception"
msgstr ""
"Drush ከ @remote የ colorbox ቤተ-መጽሐፍ (library) "
"መግባት አልቻለም። @exception"

msgid "Error: unable to unzip colorbox file."
msgstr ""
"ስህተት፡ የ colorbox ፋይሉን መፍታት (unzip) "
"አልተቻለም።"

msgid "The colorbox library has been successfully downloaded to @path."
msgstr ""
"Colorbox መጽሐፍት ላይብረሪ በ @path ውስጥ "
"በተሳካ ሁኔታ ተဒౌንሎድ ተደርጓል።"

msgid "Drush was unable to load the colorbox library"
msgstr ""
"Drush የ colorbox ቤተመጽሐፍትን (library) መጫን "
"አልቻለም።"

msgid ""
"You can find new features in the <a href=\"@url_colorbox_load\" "
"target=\"blank\">Colorbox Load</a> and <a "
"href=\"@url_colorbox_inline\" target=\"blank\">Colorbox Inline</a>"
msgstr ""
"አዲስ ባህሪዎችን በ <a href=\"@url_colorbox_load\" "
"target=\"blank\">Colorbox Load</a> እና በ <a "
"href=\"@url_colorbox_inline\" target=\"blank\">Colorbox Inline</a> "
"ውስጥ ማግኘት ይችላሉ።"

msgid "Configure view modes"
msgstr "የተመልካች ሁኔታዎችን (View modes) ያዋቅሩ"

msgid "View mode for content"
msgstr "የይዘት ለአቀራረብ ሁነታ"

msgid "View mode for Colorbox"
msgstr "د Colorbox የማሳያ ሁኔታ"

msgid "How Colorbox should group the entities."
msgstr ""
"Colorbox የአካሎቹን (entities) እንዴት "
"እንደሚያዘጋጅ (group) እንደሚገባ መመሪያ።"

msgid ""
"All entity references on a page with the same gallery value (rel "
"attribute) will be grouped together. It must only contain lowercase "
"letters, numbers, and underscores."
msgstr ""
"በඑክ ገጽ ላይ ያሉ የሁሉም አካል "
"ማጣቀሻዎች ተመሳሳይ የጋለሪ እሴት (rel "
"ባህሪ) ካላቸው በአንድ ቡድን ይሰባሰባሉ። "
"እሱ ትንንሽ ፊደሎች፣ ቁጥሮች እና መስመር "
"ማሳያ ድምብ (underscore) ብቻ ሊያካትት "
"ይገባል።"

msgid "Content view mode: @view_mode"
msgstr "የይዘት እይታ ሁነታ፦ @view_mode"

msgid "Colorbox view mode: @view_mode"
msgstr "دብሎክስ የእይታ ሁነታ፦ @view_mode"

msgid ""
"Select the style to use for the Colorbox. The example styles are the "
"ones that come with the Colorbox plugin. Select \"None\" if you have "
"added Colorbox styles to your theme.  <br> <strong>Examples</strong>: "
"<ul><li><a href=\"@img_folder_path/example_default.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">Default</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/example_plain.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">Plain</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/example_stockholm_syndrome.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">Stockholm Syndrome</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/colorbox_example_1.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">Example 1</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/colorbox_example_2.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">Example 2</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/colorbox_example_3.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">Example 3</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/colorbox_example_4.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">Example 4</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/example_none.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">None</a></li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Colorbox ለመጠቀም የሚያስፈልገውን ዘይቤ "
"ይምረጡ። የምሳሌ ዘይቤዎቹ ከ Colorbox ፕለጊን "
"ጋር የሚመጡት ናቸው። የ Colorbox ዘይቤዎችን "
"ወደ ጭብጥዎ (theme) ከጨመሩ ከሆነ “None” "
"ይምረጡ። <br> <strong>ምሳሌዎች</strong>: <ul><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/example_default.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">ነባሪ (Default)</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/example_plain.png\" target=\"blank\">ቀላል "
"(Plain)</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/example_stockholm_syndrome.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">ስቶክሆልም ሲንድሮም (Stockholm "
"Syndrome)</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/colorbox_example_1.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">ምሳሌ 1</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/colorbox_example_2.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">ምሳሌ 2</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/colorbox_example_3.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">ምሳሌ 3</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/colorbox_example_4.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">ምሳሌ 4</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/example_none.png\" target=\"blank\">ምንም "
"(None)</a></li></ul>"

msgid "DOMPurify Library"
msgstr "کتגዙ: DOMPurify መጋቢ መሣሪያ"

msgid "DOMPurify library"
msgstr "DOMPurify ቤተ-መጽሐፍት"

msgid "DOMPurify is already present at @path. No download required."
msgstr ""
"DOMPurify በ @path ውስጥ አሁንም አለ። ማውረድ "
"አያስፈልግም።"

msgid ""
"Drush was unable to download the DOMPurify library from @remote. "
"@exception"
msgstr ""
"Drush ከ @remote የ DOMPurify ቤተ-መጽሐፍ መውረድ "
"አልቻለም። @exception"

msgid "Error: unable to unzip DOMPurify file."
msgstr ""
"ስህተት፡ DOMPurify ፋይሉን መፍታት (unzip) "
"አልተቻለም።"

msgid "The DOMPurify library has been successfully downloaded to @path."
msgstr ""
"የDOMPurify ቤተ-መጽሐፍ በ@path ላይ በተሳካ "
"ሁኔታ ተဒウンሎድ ተደርጓል።"

msgid "Drush was unable to load the DOMPurify library"
msgstr ""
"Drush የ DOMPurify የማቀናበሪያ (library) መጫን "
"አልቻለም"

msgid ""
"The DOMPurify library is not installed. The Colorbox module uses this "
"library to sanitize HTML captions. Without this library, all captions "
"will be treated as plain text. If you intend to have HTML captions in "
"Colorbox content, download the <a href=\"@url\">DOMPurify library</a>, "
"extract it, and copy the dist directory into the /libraries/DOMPurify "
"folder in your Drupal installation directory. Specifically, the system "
"looks for /libraries/DOMPurify/dist/purify.min.js. <br /><br /> To "
"avoid potential security issues, please only install the dist "
"directory, and not any other files from the archive.<br /><br /> If "
"you do not intend to use HTML captions, you can suppress this warning "
"on the <a href=\"@config\">Colorbox configuration page.</a>"
msgstr ""
"የDOMPurify ቤተ-መፃህፍት (library) አልተገጠመም። "
"Colorbox ሞጁሉ ይህን ቤተ-መፃህፍት የHTML "
"ካፒሽኖችን ማጽዳት (sanitize) ለመፈጸም "
"ይጠቀማል። ይህ ቤተ-መፃህፍት ከሌለ፣ "
"ሁሉም ካፒሽኖች እንደ साधारण ጽሑፍ "
"ተቆጥረው ይያዙላሉ። በColorbox ይዘት ውስጥ "
"የHTML ካፒሽኖች ለመጠቀም ካቀዱ፣ <a "
"href=\"@url\">DOMPurify library</a> ያውርዱ፣ ያውጡ "
"(extract) እና dist ዳይሬክቶሪውን በDrupal ጭነት "
"የሚገኝበት አካባቢ ውስጥ /libraries/DOMPurify "
"ፎልደር ውስጥ ይቅዱ። በተለይ ስርዓቱ "
"የሚፈልገው /libraries/DOMPurify/dist/purify.min.js ነው። "
"<br /><br /> ሊኖሩ የሚችሉ የደህንነት ችግኝ "
"ጉዳዮችን ለመከላከል ብቻ dist "
"ዳይሬክቶሪውን ይጫኑ፣ ከarchive የተለየ "
"ማንኛውንም ፋይል አይጫኑ።<br /><br /> የHTML "
"ካፒሽኖችን መጠቀም ካላሰቡ ይህን "
"ማስጠንቀቂያ በ <a href=\"@config\">የColorbox ውቅር "
"ገጽ</a> ላይ ማሰናከል (suppress) ይችላሉ።"

msgid ""
"The DOMPurify library is installed. This library will sanitize HTML in "
"Colorbox captions."
msgstr ""
"የ DOMPurify ቤተ-መጽሐፍት (library) ተጭኗል። ይህ "
"ቤተ-መጽሐፍት በ Colorbox ካፕሽኖች (captions) "
"ውስጥ ያለውን HTML ያጸዳል (sanitize)።"

msgid ""
"The <a href=\"@dompurify_link\">DOMPurify</a> library is not "
"installed. This library is necessary if you want to use HTML in "
"Colorbox captions. Without it, all captions will be treated as plain "
"text."
msgstr ""
"የ<a href=\"@dompurify_link\">DOMPurify</a> ቤተ-መፃህፍት "
"(library) አልተገጠመም። በColorbox "
"ማስታወቂያዎች (captions) ውስጥ HTML መጠቀም "
"ከፈለጉ ይህ ቤተ-መፃህፍት አስፈላጊ ነው። "
"እሱ ካልኖረ ሁሉም ማስታወቂያዎች እንደ "
"ቀላል ጽሑፍ (plain text) ይታያሉ።"

msgid ""
"By default, a warning appears on Drupal's status report if this "
"library is missing. Check this box to suppress the warning."
msgstr ""
"በነባሪ የዚህ ቤተ-መጽሐፍ ካልተገኘ በDrupal "
"የሁኔታ ሪፖርት ላይ ማስጠንቀቂያ ይታያል። "
"ይህን ሳጥን ምልክት በማድረግ "
"ማስጠንቀቂያውን ለማብራርት (ለመደበቅ) "
"ይቻላል።"

msgid "Node responsive image style"
msgstr "Node ሬስፖንሲቭ ምስል ዓይነት"

msgid "Responsive image style for content"
msgstr ""
"የይዘብ ለመስመር ተስማሚ የምስል ቅጥ "
"(Responsive image style)"

msgid "Responsive image style for Colorbox"
msgstr "د Colorbox ያለው ለስላሳ (responsive) የምስል ዘዴ"

msgid "Responsive content image style: @style"
msgstr "ተግባራዊ የይዘት ምስል ዘይቤ፡ @style"

msgid "Responsive content image style: Original image"
msgstr ""
"ማብራሪያ ይዘት የምስል ዘይቤ (Responsive): "
"የመጀመሪያው ምስል"

msgid "Colorbox responsive image style: @style"
msgstr ""
"Colorbox ተስማሚ መጠን (responsive) የምስል ዘዴ፡ "
"@style"

msgid "Colorbox responsive image style: Original image"
msgstr "Colorbox ምላሽ ሰጪ የምስል ዘዴ፡ ዋናው ምስል"

msgid "Colorbox Responsive"
msgstr "Colorbox ሪስፖንሲቭ"

msgid ""
"If On (default), Colorbox will add a unique per-request token to the "
"gallery id to avoid images being added manually to galleries. The "
"token was added as a security fix but some see the old behavior as an "
"feature and this settings makes it possible to remove the token."
msgstr ""
"ካበራ (ነባሪ) ከሆነ፣ Colorbox ምስሎች በእጅ "
"ወደ ጋለሪዎች እንዳይጨመሩ ለመከላከል "
"የጋለሪ መታወቂያ ላይ በእያንዳንዱ ጥያቄ "
"የሚለይ ልዩ ቶከን (token) ይጨምራል። ይህ "
"ቶከን እንደ የደህንነት ማስተካከያ ተጨምሮ "
"ነበር፣ ነገር ግን አንዳንዶች የቀድሞውን "
"ባህሪ እንደ ባህሪ (feature) ይመለከቱታል እና "
"ይህ አቀማመጥ ቶከኑን ለመሰረዝ ያስችላል።"

msgid "Colorbox (view modes)"
msgstr "Colorbox (view modes)  ➝  Colorbox (የእይታ ሁኔታዎች)"

msgid "Config Ignore"
msgstr "تنረግ ማስተካከያን አትመልከት/ችላ ማለት"

msgid "Config Ignore Settings"
msgstr "የቅንብሮችን መተው (Ignore) ማስተካከያዎች"

msgid "List of ignored configurations"
msgstr "የተተዉ ውቅሮች ዝርዝር"

msgid "Configuration entity names to ignore"
msgstr ""
"የማስተናገድ መገለጫ (configuration) አካል ስሞች "
"ለመተው/ለመዝለል"

msgid "Mode of operation"
msgstr "የሥራ ሁነታ"

msgid "Configuration Ignore settings"
msgstr "የቅንብር ችላ ማለት መቼቶች"

msgid "Ignore certain configuration during imports and exports"
msgstr ""
"የማስመጣት እና የማቅረብ ጊዜ አንዳንድ "
"ማዋቀርዎችን ችላ በማለት ይሥሩ"

msgid "Operational mode"
msgstr "የኦፕሬሽናል ሁኔታ"

msgid "lists for import and export ignoring"
msgstr ""
"ላኪ/መልክ ለማድረግ ሲያስገቡና ሲያወጡ "
"የማይታሰቡ ዝርዝሮች"

msgid "List of ignored configurations on import"
msgstr ""
"በመጠባበቂያ ላይ ሲያስገባ የተተዉ ውቅሮች "
"ዝርዝር"

msgid "List of ignored configurations on export"
msgstr "በላክ (export) ወቅት የተተዉ ቅንጅቶች ዝርዝር"

msgid "Settings for advanced ignoring"
msgstr "ለላቀ ችላ ማለት የሚደረጉ ቅንብሮች"

msgid "List of created ignored configurations"
msgstr "በተፈጠሩ የችላ ተብለው ውቅሮች ዝርዝር"

msgid "List of updated ignored configurations"
msgstr "የዘመነውን ችላ የተባሉ ውቅሮች ዝርዝር"

msgid "List of deleted ignored configurations"
msgstr ""
"የተሰረዙ ችላ ተብለው የነበሩ ውቅሮች "
"ዝርዝር"

msgid ""
"This setting controls how complicated the configuration is. If you do "
"not have a use-case for a more advanced set-up the recommendation is "
"to keep it simple."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ቅንብር ውቅሩ ምን ያህል ውስብስብ "
"እንደሚሆን ይቆጣጠራል። ለበለጠ የላቀ "
"ማዋቀር የሚሆን ጉዳይ/ፍላጎት ካልዎት፣ "
"ምክሩ ዝርዝሩን ቀላል ማድረግ ነው።"

msgid "The configuration ignored in all cases"
msgstr ""
"ከሁሉም ጉዳዮች ውስጥ የተተወ ውቅር "
"(configuration)"

msgid ""
"One configuration name per line.<br />\n"
"Examples: "
"<ul>\n"
"<li>user.settings</li>\n"
"<li>views.settings</li>\n"
"<li>contact.settings</li>\n"
"<li>webform.webform.* "
"(will ignore all config entities that starts with "
"<em>webform.webform</em>)</li>\n"
"<li>*.contact_message.custom_contact_form.* "
"(will ignore all config entities that starts with "
"<em>.contact_message.custom_contact_form.</em> like fields attached to "
"a custom contact form)</li>\n"
"<li>* (will ignore "
"everything)</li>\n"
"<li>~webform.webform.contact (will force import for "
"this configuration, even if ignored by a "
"wildcard)</li>\n"
"<li>user.mail:register_no_approval_required.body "
"(will ignore the body of the no approval required email setting, but "
"will not ignore other user.mail "
"configuration.)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|* (will ignore all language "
"collections)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|* (will ignore all fr language "
"collection)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|field.field.* (will ignore all fr "
"field "
"translations)</li>\n"
"<li>~language.fr|field.field.media.file.field_media_file "
"(will force import for certain field "
"translation)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|system.site:name (will ignore just "
"the site name but in all translations)</li>\n"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"በመስመር አንድ የማዋቀር ስም ብቻ።<br "
"/>\n"
"ምሳሌዎች፦ "
"<ul>\n"
"<li>user.settings</li>\n"
"<li>views.settings</li>\n"
"<li>contact.settings</li>\n"
"<li>webform.webform.* "
"(ከ <em>webform.webform</em> ጋር የሚጀምሩ ሁሉንም "
"የማዋቀር አካላትን ችላ "
"ይላል)</li>\n"
"<li>*.contact_message.custom_contact_form.* (ከ "
"<em>.contact_message.custom_contact_form.</em> ጋር የሚጀምሩ "
"የማዋቀር አካላትን ችላ ይላል፤ ለምሳሌ "
"በብጁ የመገኛ ቅፅ የተያዙ "
"ፊልዶችን)</li>\n"
"<li>* (ሁሉንም ይችላ "
"ይላል)</li>\n"
"<li>~webform.webform.contact (ለዚህ ማዋቀር "
"ወደ ውስጥ ማስመጣት ይገድዳል፤ በ wildcard "
"እንኳን ቢችላ "
"ቢደረግ)</li>\n"
"<li>user.mail:register_no_approval_required.body "
"(የምንም ፈቃድ አያስፈልግም ተመዝጋቢ "
"ኢሜይል ቅንብር ያለውን body ችላ ይላል፤ "
"ነገር ግን ሌሎች የ user.mail ማዋቀሮችን "
"አይችላም።)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|* (ሁሉንም የቋንቋ "
"ክምችቶች ችላ ይላል)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|* "
"(ሁሉንም የ fr ቋንቋ ክምችቶች ችላ "
"ይላል)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|field.field.* (ሁሉንም የ fr "
"ፊልድ ትርጉሞች ችላ "
"ይላል)</li>\n"
"<li>~language.fr|field.field.media.file.field_media_file "
"(ለተወሰነ የፊልድ ትርጉም ማስመጣት "
"ይገድዳል)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|system.site:name (የጣቢያ "
"ስምን ብቻ ይችላል፤ በሁሉም ትርጉሞች "
"ውስጥ)</li>\n"
"</ul>"

msgid "Select theme"
msgstr "ንድፍ ምርጫ (ቴማ) ይምረጡ"

msgid "Edit context"
msgstr "የአውድ ማረምት"

msgid "Reaction"
msgstr "ምላሽ"

msgid "404"
msgstr "404 (ስልክ/ገጽ አይገኝም)"

msgid "Context (any)"
msgstr "እርምጃ (ማንኛውም)"

msgid "Context (all)"
msgstr "አውድ (ሁሉም)"

msgid "Update block"
msgstr "የእገዳ ማሻሻል"

msgid "The condition %name has been removed."
msgstr "የሁኔታው %name ተወግዷል።"

msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the %label condition?"
msgstr "%label ሁኔታውን መሰርዝ እርግጠኛ ነዎት?"

msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the %label context?"
msgstr ""
"%label ንብረት ላይ የተመለከተውን አውድ "
"ማጥፋት ትክክል መሆኑን እርግጠኛ ነዎት?"

msgid "Are you sure you want to %status the %label context?"
msgstr ""
"%label ኮንቴክስቱን በ%status ማስተካከል "
"እርግጠኛ ነዎት?"

msgid "Are you sure you want to remove the %reaction reaction."
msgstr ""
"የ %reaction ምላሽን ማስወገድ በእርግጥ "
"እርግጠኛ ነዎት?"

msgid "Request path exclusion"
msgstr "የማስተላለፊያ መንገድ መውጫ (exclusion)"

msgid "Configure filters"
msgstr "የማጣሪያዎችን ያዋቅሩ"

msgid "Entity view (@label)"
msgstr "አካል እይታ (@label)"

msgid "Label of the context"
msgstr "የአውድ መለያ"

msgid "Select entity"
msgstr "የአካል (entity) ይምረጡ"

msgid ""
"A unique machine-readable name for this @entity_type. It must only "
"contain lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores."
msgstr ""
"ለዚህ @entity_type የልዩ መኪና-ሊነበብ የሚችል "
"ስም። ትክክለኛው መሆን አለበት—ዝቅተኛ "
"ፊደሎች፣ ቁጥሮች እና አンダስ코ር ብቻ "
"እንዲይዝ።"

msgid "Entity Mask"
msgstr "ኤንቲቲ ማስክ"

msgid ""
"Allows an entity type to borrow the fields and display configuration "
"of another entity type."
msgstr ""
"የአካል ዓይነት ሌላ አካል ዓይነት "
"የመስኮች እና የማሳያ ውቅር ቅንብሮችን "
"እንዲወስድ ይፈቅዳል።"

msgid "Chaos Tools Views"
msgstr "ኦራንግ ቴክኒካል ቪውስ  (Chaos Tools Views)"

msgid ""
"This suite is primarily a set of APIs and tools to improve the "
"developer experience. It also contains a module called the Page "
"Manager whose job is to manage pages. In particular it manages panel "
"pages, but as it grows it will be able to manage far more than just "
"Panels."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ስብስብ በዋነኛነት የገንቢዎችን ልምድ "
"ለማሻሻል የተዘጋጁ ኤፒአይዎች እና "
"መሣሪያዎች ነው። እንዲሁም ገጾችን "
"ለመቆጣጠር የሚሰራ “Page Manager” የሚባል "
"ሞጁል ይዟል። በተለይም የፓነል ገጾችን "
"ይቆጣጠራል፤ ነገር ግን እየተሻሻለ ሲሄድ "
"ከፓነሎች ብቻ በላይ ብዙ ነገሮችን "
"መቆጣጠር ይችላል።"

msgid ""
"Plugins -- tools to make it easy for modules to let other modules "
"implement plugins from .inc files."
msgstr ""
"Plugins — ለሞጁሎች እንዲረዳቸው ሌሎች "
"ሞጁሎች ከ .inc ፋይሎች ውስጥ ፕላጊኖችን "
"እንዲተገብሩ ቀላል እንዲያደርጉ "
"የሚያገለግሉ መሳሪያዎች።"

msgid ""
"Exportables -- tools to make it easier for modules to have objects "
"that live in database or live in code, such as \"default views\"."
msgstr ""
"የሚላኩ (Exportables) — ሞጁሎች ውስጥ በዳታቤዝ "
"ውስጥ የሚኖሩ ወይም በኮድ ውስጥ የሚኖሩ "
"ኦብጀክቶች እንዲኖሩ (ለምሳሌ “default views”) "
"ያስችል የቀለለ መሳሪያዎች።"

msgid ""
"AJAX responder -- tools to make it easier for the server to handle "
"AJAX requests and tell the client what to do with them."
msgstr ""
"ኤ이Џክስ ተመላሽ — ለአገልጋዩ ኤጄክስ "
"ጥያቄዎችን ለመንከባከብ ቀላል ለማድረግ "
"እና እነሱን ምን እንዲያደርግ ለደንበኛው "
"ለመንገር የሚያገለግሉ መሳሪያዎች።"

msgid "Form tools -- tools to make it easier for forms to deal with AJAX."
msgstr ""
"የቅጽ መሳሪያዎች — ቅጾች ከAJAX ጋር "
"ለመስራት የሚያቀላጥፉ መሳሪያዎች።"

msgid ""
"Object caching -- tool to make it easier to edit an object across "
"multiple page requests and cache the editing work."
msgstr ""
"ኦብጀክት ኬሸንግ — አንድን ነገር "
"(ኦብጀክት) በብዙ የገጽ ጥያቄዎች ላይ "
"ለማረም እና የማረም ሥራውን ለመቀመጥ (ኬሸ) "
"እንዲቻል የሚያደርግ መሳሪያ።"

msgid ""
"Contexts -- the notion of wrapping objects in a unified wrapper and "
"providing an API to create and accept these contexts as input."
msgstr ""
"ኮንቴክስቶች — አብሮ የሚያካትት አንድ "
"አጠቃላይ ማቀፊያ (wrapper) ውስጥ ነገሮችን "
"በማሸፈን እና እነዚህን ኮንቴክስቶች እንደ "
"ግብዓት የሚፈጥር እና የሚቀበል ኤፒአይ (API) "
"በመስጠት የሚለው ጽንሰ-ሐሳብ።"

msgid ""
"Modal dialog -- tool to make it simple to put a form in a modal "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"የሞዳል ዳይሎግ — ቀላል እንዲሆን ቅጹን "
"በሞዳል ዳይሎግ ውስጥ ለማስገባት መሳሪያ።"

msgid ""
"Dependent -- a simple form widget to make form items appear and "
"disappear based upon the selections in another item."
msgstr ""
"ማስተማመን ያለበት — ቀላል የቅጽ መግቢያ "
"መሳሪያ (widget) ነው፤ እርስዎ በሌላ አንድ "
"እቃ (item) ላይ በሚደረጉ ምርጫዎች መሠረት "
"የቅጽ እቃዎች እንዲታዩ ወይም እንዲጠፉ "
"ለማድረግ ይረዳል።"

msgid ""
"Content -- pluggable content types used as panes in Panels and other "
"modules like Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ይዘት — በPanels እና በDashboard የመሳሰሉ ሌሎች "
"ሞጁሎች ውስጥ እንደ ፓነሎች ለመጠቀም "
"የሚችሉ ተለዋዋጭ ይዘት ዓይነቶች (pluggable "
"content types)።"

msgid "Form wizard -- an API to make multi-step forms much easier."
msgstr ""
"የፎርም ዊዛርድ — ብዙ ደረጃ ያላቸው "
"ፎርሞችን በጣም ቀላል ለማድረግ "
"የሚያገለግል ኤፒአይ።"

msgid ""
"CSS tools -- tools to cache and sanitize CSS easily to make user-input "
"CSS safe."
msgstr ""
"የ CSS መሳሪያዎች — ተጠቃሚ ግብዓት (user-input) "
"CSS እንዳይበላሽ/እንዳይጎዳ ደህንነቱን "
"ለመጠበቅ በቀላሉ ለመያዝ (cache) እና "
"ለማፅዳት (sanitize) የሚረዱ መሳሪያዎች።"

msgid "Exposed filter values"
msgstr "በሚታዩ የማጣሪያ እሴቶች"

msgid ""
"If a value is set for an exposed filter, it will be removed from the "
"block display."
msgstr ""
"የተጋለጠ ፊልተር ላይ እሴት ከተዘጋጀ "
"በብሎክ ማሳያው ላይ ከዚያ ይወገዳል።"

msgid "Expose filter value to user"
msgstr "የማጣሪያ እሴቱን ለተጠቃሚው አሳይ"

msgid ""
"Expose this filter value to visitors? If so, the value set here will "
"be the default."
msgstr ""
"ይህን ፊልተር እሴት ለጎብኚዎች ማሳየት "
"ይፈልጋሉ? ከሆነ፣ እዚህ የተቀመጠው እሴት "
"ነባሪ (default) ሆኖ ይወሰዳል።"

msgid "Expose filter operator to user"
msgstr "የማጣሪያ ኦፕሬተርን ለተጠቃሚው ያሳይ"

msgid ""
"Expose this filter's operator to visitors? If so, the operator set "
"here will be the default."
msgstr ""
"ይህን ማጣሪያ (filter) ኦፕሬተር ለጎብኚዎች "
"ተደራሽ እንዲሆን ታስባለህ? ከሆነ፣ እዚህ "
"የተቀመጠው ኦፕሬተር ነባሪ (default) ይሆናል።"

msgid "Disable filter: @handler"
msgstr "ማጣሪያ አቦዝን፡ @handler"

msgid "Update Status"
msgstr "የሁኔታ ማዘመን"

msgid "Administer blocks"
msgstr "ብሎኮችን አስተዳድር"

msgid "Creating content"
msgstr "ይዘት መፍጠር"

msgid "Configuration files"
msgstr "የቅንብር ፋይሎች"

msgid "Default moderation state"
msgstr "የነባሪ ማጽደቅ ሁኔታ"

msgid "Theme files"
msgstr "የቅጥ (Theme) ፋይሎች"

msgid "Customize field and label wrapper HTML"
msgstr ""
"የመስክ እና መለያ ዕቃ (label wrapper) HTML ን "
"ያብጁ"

msgid "Module files"
msgstr "የሞጁል ፋይሎች"

msgid "@label has been removed."
msgstr "@label ተወግዷል።"

msgid "Link text not trimmed"
msgstr "የማገናኛ ጽሑፍ አልተቆረጠም"

msgid "Translations directory"
msgstr "የትርጉም ማውጫ"

msgid "The parents of this term."
msgstr "የዚህ ቃል ወላጆች።"

msgctxt "Sort order"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "ትዕዛዝ"

msgid "Entity links"
msgstr "አካል ማገናኛዎች"

msgid "About text formats"
msgstr "የጽሁፍ ቅርጸቶች ስለ ጽሁፍ"

msgid "One or more names separated by , or +"
msgstr ""
"ከነገር በታች ተለይተው የተገኙ አንድ "
"ወይም ከዚያ በላይ ስሞች፣ በ , ወይም + "
"ተለይተው"

msgid "Title field required"
msgstr "የርዕስ መስክ ያስፈልጋል"

msgid "Boolean string"
msgstr "ቦሊያን ሕብረቀ ሐረግ"

msgid "OPML Feed"
msgstr "OPML ፊድ"

msgid "Entity Reference reference access"
msgstr "የአካል ማጣቀሻ መዳረሻ"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Email"
msgstr "ኢሜይል"

msgid "Duplicate responsive image style"
msgstr ""
"ምስል አብሮ የሚሰራ (responsive) የምስል ዘዴን "
"ቅጂ ማድረግ"

msgid "Translate interface text"
msgstr "“የተጠቃሚ መገናኛ ጽሑፍን ተርጉም”"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of messages to keep in the database log. Requires a "
"<a href=\":cron\">cron maintenance task</a>."
msgstr ""
"የውሂብ መዝገብ መዝገብ ውስጥ ለመቆየት "
"የሚፈቀድ ከፍተኛ የመልዕክቶች ብዛት። ይህ "
"እንዲፈጸም <a href=\":cron\">የcron ጥገና "
"ተግባር</a> ያስፈልጋል።"

msgid "Deprecated: Use account-name or display-name instead."
msgstr ""
"ወረራ የተቋረጠ፦ በምትካቸው account-name ወይም "
"display-name ን ይጠቀሙ።"

msgid "Workspaces"
msgstr "የሥራ ቦታዎች"

msgid "Use custom display settings for the following @display_context modes"
msgstr ""
"የሚከተሉትን @display_context ሁነቶች ለመጠቀም "
"ብጁ የማሳያ ቅንብሮችን ይጠቀሙ"

msgid "Supported entity types"
msgstr "የተደገፉ የአካል ዓይነቶች"

msgid "The theme settings variable value."
msgstr "دテーマ تنظیمት ቁመት መጠን ዋጋው።"

msgid "Use audio files for reusable media."
msgstr ""
"የድምፅ ፋይሎችን ለዳግም መጠቀም የሚቻል "
"ሚዲያ ይጠቀሙ።"

msgid "contact message"
msgstr "የእውቂያ መልእክት"

msgid "Allowed media types, in display order"
msgstr ""
"በተ ప్రదర్శት ማዘዣ መሠረት የተፈቀዱ "
"የሚዲያ ዓይነቶች"

msgid ""
"Vendor filesystem \"@vendor\" has insufficient space. There must be at "
"least @space megabytes free."
msgstr ""
"የሻጭ ፋይል ስርዓት “@vendor” በቂ ቦታ "
"የለውም። ቢያንስ @space ሜጋባይት ነፃ ቦታ "
"መኖር አለበት።"

msgid "Plays inline"
msgstr "በመስመር ውስጥ ይጫወታል"

msgid ""
"You can embed media items (using the <code>&lt;drupal-media&gt;</code> "
"tag)."
msgstr ""
"మీడియա እቃዎችን (በ "
"<code>&lt;drupal-media&gt;</code> ታግ በመጠቀም) ማካተት "
"ይችላሉ።"

msgid "Logs system events in the database."
msgstr ""
"የስርዓቱን ክስተቶች በዳታቤዝ ውስጥ "
"መመዝገብ።"

msgid "Check <em>Make this the default form</em> and click <em>Save</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>ይህን ነባር ቅጽ ያድርጉት</em> ተጫን እና "
"<em>አስቀምጥ</em> ንካ።"

msgid "Online documentation for the RESTful Web Services module"
msgstr "የ RESTful Web Services ሞጁል ለመስመር ላይ ሰነዶች"

msgid ""
"The core Media Library module provides the media library and the Media "
"library field widget. With this module installed, the Media library "
"field widget becomes the default widget for editing Media reference "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"የኮር ሚዲያ ላይብረሪ ሞጁሉ የሚዲያ "
"ላይብረሪንና የሚዲያ ላይብረሪ መስክ "
"የመትግበሪያ (field widget) ይሰጣል። ይህ ሞጁል "
"ከተገጠመ በኋላ የሚዲያ ላይብረሪ መስክ "
"የመትግበሪያው የሚዲያ ማጣቀሻ (Media reference) "
"መስኮችን ለመትከል ነባሪ (default) "
"የመትግበሪያ ይሆናል።"

msgid ""
"<em>Threading</em>: whether or not the comments are collected by "
"threads, with people able to reply to particular comments instead of "
"to the content entity itself."
msgstr ""
"<em>Threading</em>: እውስት አስተያየቶች በክር "
"(threads) የሚሰበሰቡ እንደሆነ ወይም "
"እንዳልሆነ—እንዲሁም ሰዎች በተወሰኑ "
"አስተያየቶች ላይ ብቻ መመለስ የሚችሉ "
"ከሆነ በይዘት አካሉ (content entity) ላይ በቀጥታ "
"መልስ ከመስጠት ይልቅ።"

msgid ""
"Follow the steps in @search_index_topic to make sure that the search "
"index is updated."
msgstr ""
"@search_index_topic ውስጥ ያሉትን እርምጃዎች "
"ተከትለው የፍለጋ ኢንዴክሱ መዘመኑን "
"እንደሚያረጋግጡ ያረጋግጡ።"

msgid "The vendor directory \"@dir\" is not writable."
msgstr ""
"የአቅራቢው ዳይሬክቶሪ \"@dir\" ሊፃፍ "
"አይችልም።"

msgid ""
"The CKEditor 5 \"%cke5_media_plugin_label\" plugin's "
"\"%cke5_allow_view_mode_override_label\" setting should be in sync "
"with the \"%filter_media_plugin_label\" filter's "
"\"%filter_media_allowed_view_modes_label\" setting: when checked, two "
"or more view modes must be allowed by the filter."
msgstr ""
"የ CKEditor 5 ውስጥ ያለው “%cke5_media_plugin_label” "
"ፕለጊን “%cke5_allow_view_mode_override_label” "
"የሚባለው ማስተካከያ ከ "
"“%filter_media_plugin_label” የማጣሪያ  "
"“%filter_media_allowed_view_modes_label” ማስተካከያ ጋር "
"እንዲሄድ መሆን አለበት፦ ሲመረጥ (checked) "
"ከሁለት ወይም ከበለጠ የእይታ ሁነታዎች "
"በማጣሪያው መፈቀድ አለባቸው።"

msgid "Allowed entity types"
msgstr "አፈቀዱ እኩልነቶች (entity types)"

msgid ""
"The Drupal application's codebase must be writable in order to use "
"Automatic Updates. This includes Drupal core, modules, themes and the "
"Composer dependencies in the <code>vendor</code> directory. This makes "
"Automatic Updates incompatible with some hosting platforms."
msgstr ""
"Drupal የትግበራ ኮድ ቤዝ (codebase) ራሱ ሊጻፍ "
"(writable) መቻል አለበት የሚሆነው የ Automatic "
"Updates (ራስ የሚያዘምን) ለመጠቀም ነው። ይህ "
"በ Drupal core፣ modules፣ themes እና በ <code>vendor</code> "
"ዳይሬክቶሪ ውስጥ ያሉትን የ Composer "
"ጥገኝነቶች (dependencies) ይጨምራል። ይህም "
"Automatic Updates ከአချို့ የ "
"φιበር/ማስተናገጃ (hosting) መድረኮች ጋር "
"የማይስማማ ያደርጋል።"

msgid ""
"Staged changes failed to apply, and the site is in an indeterminate "
"state. It is strongly recommended to restore the code and database "
"from a backup."
msgstr ""
"የተዘጋጁ ለውጦች መተግበር አልተሳካም እና "
"ድረ-ገጹ ያልተገለጸ ሁኔታ (indeterminate state) "
"ውስጥ ነው። ከቅድሚያ በተደረገ ምትኬ "
"ውስጥ ኮዱን እና ዳታቤዙን መመለስ በጣም "
"ጠንካራ የሚመከር ነው።"

msgid ""
"Post-apply tasks are running in the same request during which staged "
"changes were applied to the active code base. This can result in "
"unpredictable behavior."
msgstr ""
"ተቀያየሩ ለንቁ ኮድ ቤዝ ላይ ተፈጸሙ "
"በሚደረጉበት ተመሳሳይ ጥያቄ (request) ውስጥ "
"የሚሄዱ የትግበራ-በኋላ (post-apply) ተግባራት "
"እየተሰሩ ይታያሉ። ይህ አስተማማኝ ያልሆነ "
"(አልተገመተ) ባህሪ ሊያስከትል ይችላል።"

msgid ""
"API module providing functionality to stage package installs and "
"updates with Composer."
msgstr ""
"Composer ከሚያቀርበው ጋር የፓኬጅ መጫንና "
"ዝማኔዎችን ለማብራሪያ (staging) የሚያገለግል "
"ተግባር የሚሰጥ የ API ሞጁል።"

msgid "There is not enough disk space to create a stage directory."
msgstr ""
"የመድረክ ዳይሬክቶሪ ለመፍጠር በቂ የዲስክ "
"ቦታ የለም።"

msgid ""
"The stage directory has @stage_count instances of @stage_info_file as "
"compared to @active_count in the active directory. This likely "
"indicates that a duplicate extension was installed."
msgstr ""
"የስቴጅ (stage) ዳይሬክቶሪው በសማሰል (active) "
"ዳይሬክቶሪው ውስጥ ካለው @active_count ጋር "
"ሲነፃፀር @stage_count ጊዜ @stage_info_file "
"ተገኝቷል። ይህ সম्भवነት የድግግሞሽ "
"(duplicate) ኤክስቴንሽን ተጭኗል ማሳያ ነው።"

msgid ""
"The stage directory has @stage_count instances of @stage_info_file. "
"This likely indicates that a duplicate extension was installed."
msgstr ""
"የደረጃው መዝገብ በ@stage_count ቅጂዎች ውስጥ "
"@stage_info_file እንዳለው ያሳያል። ይህ "
"ምናልባት የተባዛ ቅጥያ (extension) "
"እንደተገติด ያመለክታል።"

msgid "The stage root directory will not able to be created at \"@dir\"."
msgstr ""
"በ“@dir” ላይ የደረጃ ዋና አቃፊ (stage root "
"directory) መፍጠር አይቻልም።"

msgid "The stage root directory \"@dir\" is not writable."
msgstr ""
"የመድረክ የስር ዳይሬክቶሪ “@dir” ሊፃፍ "
"አይችልም።"

msgid ""
"It only allows supported Composer plugins. If you have any, see <a "
"href=\"#package-manager-faq-unsupported-composer-plugin\">What if it "
"says I have unsupported Composer plugins in my codebase?</a>."
msgstr ""
"እሱ የተደገፉ የComposer ፕላጊኖችን ብቻ "
"ይፈቅዳል። ካሉዎት፣ <a "
"href=\"#package-manager-faq-unsupported-composer-plugin\">ኮードቤዝዬ "
"ውስጥ የማይደገፉ Composer ፕላጊኖች አሉ ብሎ "
"ከተናገረ ምን ይሆናል?</a> ይመልከቱ።"

msgid ""
"If <code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> is installed, it must be "
"defined as a dependency of the main project (i.e., it must be listed "
"in the <code>require</code> or <code>require-dev</code> section of "
"<code>composer.json</code>). You can run the following command in your "
"site root to add it as a dependency of the main project:"
msgstr ""
"اگر <code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> ተጭኗል "
"ከሆነ፣ እሱ እንደ ዋናው ፕሮጀክት "
"የጥገኝነት (dependency) ሆኖ መወሰን አለበት "
"(ማለትም በ <code>composer.json</code> ውስጥ በ "
"<code>require</code> ወይም <code>require-dev</code> ክፍል "
"ውስጥ መመዝገብ አለበት)። ይህን እንደ "
"ዋናው ፕሮጀክት የጥገኝነት ለመጨመር "
"ከተለመደው የጣቢያዎ ሥር (site root) ውስጥ "
"የሚከተለውን ትዕዛዝ ማስኬድ ይችላሉ፦"

msgid "Cannot claim the stage because no stage has been created."
msgstr ""
"ደረጃውን መጠየቅ አይቻልም፤ ደረጃ ገና "
"አልተፈጠረም።"

msgid ""
"All composer plugins are allowed because "
"<code>config.allow-plugins</code> is configured to <code>true</code>. "
"This is an unacceptable security risk."
msgstr ""
"ሁሉም composer ፕለጊኖች ይፈቀዳሉ ምክንያቱም "
"<code>config.allow-plugins</code> ወደ <code>true</code> "
"ተዋቅሮአል። ይህ የማይቀበል የደህንነት "
"አደጋ ነው።"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Extension exists"
msgstr "ቅጥያ አለ።"

msgid ""
"The breakpoint group typically only needs a single breakpoint with an "
"empty media query in order to do <em>viewport sizing.</em> Multiple "
"breakpoints are used for changing the crop or aspect ratio of images "
"at different viewport sizes, which is often referred to as <em>art "
"direction.</em> A new breakpoint group should be created for each "
"aspect ratio to avoid content shift. Once you select a breakpoint "
"group, you can choose which breakpoints to use for the responsive "
"image style. By default, the option <em>do not use this "
"breakpoint</em> is selected for each breakpoint. See the <a "
"href=\":breakpoint_help\">help page of the Breakpoint module</a> for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"የብሬክፖይንት ቡድን (breakpoint group) ብዙ ጊዜ "
"<em>የviewport መጠን መተያየት (viewport sizing)</em> "
"ለማድረግ አንድ ብዙ ብሬክፖይንት (breakpoint) "
"ብቻ በአስፈላጊ ሁኔታ ባዶ የሚዲያ ጥያቄ "
"(media query) ያለው ብሬክፖይንት ብቻ በቂ ነው። "
"ብዙ ብሬክፖይንቶች በተለያዩ የviewport "
"መጠኖች ላይ የምስሎችን መከርከም (crop) "
"ወይም የአስፈላጊ ሬሾ (aspect ratio) ለመቀየር "
"ይጠቅማሉ፤ ይህ ብዙ ጊዜ <em>art direction</em> "
"ተብሎ ይጠራል። ይዘት መንቀሳቀስ (content shift) "
"እንዳይኖር አዲስ የብሬክፖይንት ቡድን "
"ለእያንዳንዱ የአስፈላጊ ሬሾ መፍጠር "
"አስፈላጊ ነው። አንዴ የብሬክፖይንት ቡድን "
"ከመረጡ በኋላ ለresponsive image style ምን "
"ብሬክፖይንቶች እንደሚጠቀሙ መምረጥ "
"ይችላሉ። በነባሪ (default) ሁኔታ በእያንዳንዱ "
"ብሬክፖይንት ላይ <em>do not use this breakpoint</em> "
"የሚለው አማራጭ ተመርጦ ይኖራል። ለተጨማሪ "
"መረጃ <a href=\":breakpoint_help\">የBreakpoint module "
"የእርዳታ ገጽ</a> ይመልከቱ።"

msgid ""
"Composer must be configured for secure downloads. This means that <a "
"href=\":disable-tls\">the <code>disable-tls</code> option</a> must be "
"<code>false</code>, and <a href=\":secure-http\">the "
"<code>secure-http</code> option</a> must be <code>true</code> in the "
"<code>config</code> section of your <code>composer.json</code> file. "
"If these options are not set in your <code>composer.json</code>, "
"Composer will behave securely by default. To set these values at the "
"command line, run the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Composer ደህንነታቸው የተጠበቀ ማውረዶች (secure "
"downloads) እንዲያከናውን ማዋቀር አለበት። "
"ማለትም <a href=\":disable-tls\">የ <code>disable-tls</code> "
"አማራጭ</a> መሆን አለበት <code>false</code>፣ እና "
"<a href=\":secure-http\">የ <code>secure-http</code> አማራጭ</a> "
"መሆን አለበት <code>true</code> በ "
"<code>composer.json</code> ፋይልዎ ውስጥ በሚገኘው በ "
"<code>config</code> ክፍል ውስጥ መሆኑ ነው። "
"እነዚህ አማራጮች በ <code>composer.json</code> ውስጥ "
"ካልተቀመጡ በነባሪ (default) Composer የደህንነት "
"ሁኔታን በብዙ ሁኔታ ይተግብራል። እነዚህን "
"እሴቶች በትዕዛዝ መስመር (command line) ላይ "
"ለመስጠት የሚከተሉትን ትዕዛዞች ያስኬዱ፣"

msgid "Problem detected in lock file during stage operations."
msgid_plural "Problems detected in lock file during stage operations."
msgstr[0] ""
"የማስተካከያ ፋይል (lock file) ውስጥ በደረጃ "
"ክዋኔዎች (stage operations) ጊዜ ችግኝ "
"ተገτόቷል።  \n"
"በደረጃ ክዋኔዎች ጊዜ "
"የማስተካከያ ፋይል (lock file) ውስጥ ችግኝ "
"ተገτόቷል።"

msgid ""
"The stage directory is not protected by PHP-TUF, which is required to "
"use Package Manager securely."
msgstr ""
"የመድረክ ዳይሬክቶሪው በPHP-TUF የተጠበቀ "
"አይደለም፣ ይህም ፓኬጅ መያዣ (Package Manager) ን "
"በደህና ለመጠቀም ያስፈልጋል።"

msgid ""
"There appear to be no pending Composer operations because the active "
"lock file (@active_file) and the staged lock file (@staged_file) are "
"identical."
msgstr ""
"እንዲህ ያሉ ተጠባባቂ የComposer ኦፕሬሽኖች "
"የሚመስሉ አይደሉም፣ ምክንያቱም ንቁው "
"መቆለፊያ ፋይል (@active_file) እና ዝግጅት "
"የተደረገው መቆለፊያ ፋይል (@staged_file) "
"ተመሳሳይ ናቸው።"

msgid "The field %field has been deleted from the %type %source_label."
msgstr ""
"የ %field መስኩ ከ %type %source_label ውስጥ "
"ተሰርዟል።"

msgid "Stage directory cleaner"
msgstr "የደረጃ ከማውጫ ማጽጃ መሳሪያ"

msgid ""
"Include unrecognized files and directories in the project root in "
"staging operations"
msgstr ""
"የመረጃ ማከማቻው ስር በክዋኔዎች ጊዜ "
"የማይታወቁ ፋይሎችን እና ንዑስ "
"ዳይሬክቶሪዎችን ከፕሮጀክቱ ሥር ውስጥ "
"አካትት።"

msgid "Rebuild content access permissions"
msgstr ""
"የይዘት መዳረሻ ፍቃዶችን እንደገና "
"ገንባ/ተመን ማድረግ"

msgid ""
"The @name config object does not contain any translatable values, so "
"it should not specify a language code."
msgstr ""
"የ @name ውቅር ነገር የማስተካከያ (translatable) "
"እሴቶች የለውም፤ ስለዚህ የቋንቋ ኮድ "
"መግለጽ አይኖርበትም።"

msgid ""
"Path of a file to which Composer Stager process output should be "
"logged"
msgstr ""
"የ Composer Stager ሂደት ውጤት መመዝገብ ያለበት "
"የፋይሉ መንገድ"

msgid "TUF is not enabled for the <code>@url</code> repository."
msgstr "TUF ለ<code>@url</code> ሪፖዚቶሪ አልተነቃም።"

msgid ""
"The Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks module is a Feature Flag "
"module which exposes all fields on all bundles as field blocks for use "
"in Layout Builder."
msgstr ""
"የ«Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks» ሞጁል ሁሉንም "
"መስኮች በሁሉም ቡንዶች ላይ ለLayout Builder "
"እንዲጠቀሙ እንደ መስክ ብሎኮች የሚያጋልጥ "
"የFeature Flag ሞጁል ነው።"

msgid ""
"For example, if Layout Builder is enabled on a Node bundle (Content "
"type), and that bundle's display is using field blocks from the User "
"entity (e.g. the Author's name), but Layout Builder is not enabled for "
"the User bundle, then that field block would no longer exist after "
"uninstalling this module."
msgstr ""
"ለምሳሌ፣ Layout Builder በNode ባለብዙ ክፍል (Content "
"type) ላይ እንዳበራ እና ይህ ክፍል ትርኢት "
"(display) ከUser አካል (ለምሳሌ የጸሐፊው ስም) "
"የሚመጡ የfield blocks ተጠቅሞ ከሆነ፣ ነገር "
"ግን ለUser ክፍል ላይ Layout Builder ካልተነቃ "
"ከሆነ፣ ይህ field block ይህ ሞጁሉ ከተወገደ "
"(uninstall) በኋላ እንደገና አይኖርም።"

msgid ""
"You can <em>only</em> add workflows on the <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows page</a>, after you have installed a "
"module that leverages the API such as the <a "
"href=\":moderation\">Content Moderation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"మీరు <a href=\":workflows\">የ Workflows ገጽ</a> ላይ "
"ብቻ <em>workflow</em> መጨመር ይችላሉ፤ እንዲሁም "
"እንደ <a href=\":moderation\">የ Content Moderation ሞጁል</a> "
"ያሉ የ API ን የሚጠቀሙ ሞጁሎችን ካስገቡ "
"በኋላ ነው።"

msgid ""
"You can <em>only</em> add workflows on the <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows page</a>, after you have installed a "
"module that leverages the API such as the Content Moderation module."
msgstr ""
"የ API ን እንደሚጠቀም ሞጁል ከጫኑ በኋላ "
"ብቻ፣ እንደ Content Moderation ሞጁሉ ያለ፣ በ<a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows ገጽ</a> ላይ <em>ብቻ</em> "
"የሚታገዱ የስርዓተ-ሥራ (workflows) ሊጨምሩ "
"ይችላሉ።"

msgid ""
"A workflow requires at least two states. States can be added when you "
"add or edit a workflow on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"የስራ ፍሰት (workflow) לפን ቢያንስ ሁለት "
"ሁኔታዎች (states) ይፈልጋል። ሁኔታዎችን በ<a "
"href=\":workflows\">የ Workflows ገጽ</a> ላይ ሲያክሉ "
"ወይም ሲያርቱ የስራ ፍሰት ሲያዘጋጁ "
"ሊጨምሩ ይችላሉ።"

msgid ""
"A transition defines in which state an item can be save as next. It "
"has one destination state, but can have several states <em>from</em> "
"which the transition can be applied. Transitions can be added when you "
"add or edit a workflow on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"አንድ ሽግግር (transition) በሚቀጥለው ደረጃ "
"እቃው በማንኛው ሁኔታ እንደሚቀመጥ (save) "
"መግለጫ ይሰጣል። እሱ አንድ የመዳረሻ "
"ሁኔታ (destination state) አለው፣ ነገር ግን "
"<em>from</em> ተብለው የሚጠቀሱ ብዙ ሁኔታዎች "
"ሊኖሩ ይችላሉ—ከእነዚህም ሁኔታዎች ላይ "
"ሽግግሩ ሊተገበር ይችላል። በአንድ <a "
"href=\":workflows\">የ Workflows ገጽ</a> ላይ ወርክፍሎው "
"(workflow) ሲጨምሩ ወይም ሲያስተካክሉ "
"ሽግግሮች (transitions) ሊጨመሩ ይችላሉ።"

msgid ""
"The UploadProgress PHP extension must be enabled to configure the "
"progress indicator. Check the <a href=\":status\">status report</a> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"پროგریسን ለማሳየት መቼቱን ለመዋቀር "
"UploadProgress PHP ማስፈጸሚያ (extension) እንዲነቃ "
"ያስፈልጋል። ለበለጠ መረጃ <a "
"href=\":status\">የሁኔታ ሪፖርት</a>ን ይመልከቱ።"

msgid "Whether or not to enable TLS opportunistically (defaults to true)."
msgstr ""
"TLSን በአጋጣሚ ሁኔታ (ነባሪ እሴት true ነው) "
"ማንቃት ይፈልጉ ይሆን አይሆን የሚወስን።"

msgid "Whether or not to enforce TLS (defaults to false)."
msgstr ""
"TLS እንዲገደድ አଥንም አይሁን (ነባሪው false "
"ነው)።"

msgid "Bind to a specific IPv4 or IPv6 address (no default)."
msgstr ""
"ልዩ የሆነ IPv4 ወይም IPv6 አድራሻ ላይ ተቆራኝ "
"(ነባሪ የለም)።"

msgid "Installed %module module."
msgid_plural "Installed %module modules."
msgstr[0] ""
"ተገብሯል %module ሞጁል። ተገብሯል %module "
"ሞጁሎች።"

msgid "Set property of a config entity"
msgstr ""
"دራቭል አካል (config entity) የባህሪ እሴት "
"አዘጋጅ"

msgid "This value is not a valid extension name."
msgstr ""
"ይህ እሴት ትክክለኛ የቅጥያ ስም (extension name) "
"አይደለም።"

msgid "Menu link depth"
msgstr "የምናሌ አገናኝ ጥልቀት"

msgid "Preprocess callback is not valid: %error."
msgstr ""
"የቅድመ-ሂደት (preprocess) ኮልባክ ትክክል "
"አይደለም፡ %error."

msgid "IdenticalTo"
msgstr "ከሁሉ ጋር ተመሳሳይ"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "At least one of"
msgstr "ቢያንስ አንዱ ከሚከተሉት"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Call a method on a service"
msgstr "በአገልግሎት ላይ ዘዴ (method) አስጠራ/ጥራ"

msgid "Plays Inline"
msgstr "በመስመር ውስጥ ይጫወታል"

msgid "Plays Inline: %playsinline"
msgstr "በመስመር ላይ ይጫወታል፦ %playsinline"

msgid ""
"The core Language module lets you add new languages to your site, "
"provides the <em>Language switcher</em> block, and provides the "
"ability to configure block visibility by language; the block and block "
"visibility settings are only available if you have multiple languages "
"configured. The core Content Translation, Configuration Translation, "
"and Interface Translation modules let you translate content, "
"configuration, and the built-in user interface, respectively. The core "
"Locale module manages automatic downloads of community-provided "
"translations of default configuration and user-interface text if the "
"core Update Status module is installed. See the related topics listed "
"below for specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"የኮር ቋንቋ (Language) ሞጁሉ በድረ-ገጽዎ ላይ "
"አዳዲስ ቋንቋዎችን ለመጨመር ያስችላል፣ "
"<em>የቋንቋ መቀየሪያ (Language switcher)</em> ብሎክን "
"ይሰጣል፣ እንዲሁም ብሎኩን በቋንቋ መሰረት "
"ለመታየት በማዋቀር አቅም ይሰጣል፤ ይህ "
"ብሎክ እና የብሎክ መታየት ቅንብሮች ብዙ "
"ቋንቋዎች ካዋቀሩ ብቻ ይታያሉ። የኮር "
"ይዘት ትርጉም (Content Translation)፣ የቅንብር "
"ትርጉም (Configuration Translation) እና የበይነገጽ "
"ትርጉም (Interface Translation) ሞጁሎች ይዘትን፣ "
"ቅንብርን እና የተካተተውን የተጠቃሚ "
"በይነገጽ እርምጃ እንዲሁም በየነገጽ ላይ "
"የተገኘውን ጽሑፍ እንዲተረጉሙ ይፈቅዳሉ። "
"የኮር ሎኬል (Locale) ሞጁል የUpdate Status ሞጁል "
"ካለ የተለመዱ ቅንብሮች እና የተጠቃሚ "
"በይነገጽ ጽሑፍ ላይ ከማህበረሰቡ የሚቀርቡ "
"ትርጉሞችን ራስ-ሰር ማውረድ ይንከባከባል። "
"ለተወሰኑ ተግባራት ქከታች የተዘረዘሩትን "
"ተዛማጅ ጉዳዮች ይመልከቱ።"

msgid ""
"Wait for the translation system to be updated. Also, if you have the "
"core Update Status module installed and translations are available for "
"your language, wait for translations to be downloaded. You should be "
"returned to the <em>Languages</em> page when this completes."
msgstr ""
"ትርጉም ስርዓቱ እስኪዘመን ድረስ ይጠብቁ። "
"በተጨማሪም፣ የ core Update Status ሞጁሉን ካስገቡ "
"እና ለቋንቋዎ ትርጉሞች ካሉ፣ ትርጉሞቹ "
"እንዲወርዱ ይጠብቁ። ይህ ከተጠናቀቀ በኋላ "
"<em>Languages</em> ገጽ ላይ እንደገና ይመለሱልዎ።"

msgid "Ignoring already imported translation for %project."
msgstr ""
"የቀድሞውን ተጠቃሚ ትርጉም ለ %project "
"እየተجاهለበ ነው።"

msgid ""
"Obsolete. All the functionality has been moved to the navigation "
"module."
msgstr ""
"ይህ የተወገደ ነው። ተግባራቱ ሁሉ ወደ "
"አሰሳ ሞጁሉ ተዛውረዋል።"

msgid ""
"Forms and links inside the content of the layout builder tool are "
"disabled in Edit mode."
msgstr ""
"ከእትም (Edit) ሁነታ ውስጥ ሆነው በአቀማመጥ "
"ገንቢ (Layout Builder) መሳሪያ ውስጥ ያለው ይዘት "
"ውስጥ ያሉ ቅጾች (Forms) እና አገናኞች (links) "
"ተዘግተዋል።"

msgid "@state_label (@active_state_label available)"
msgstr "@state_label（@active_state_label ይገኛል ሲሆን）"

msgid "Page Context"
msgstr "የገጽ አውድ (Page Context)"

msgid "Administrative top bar"
msgstr "የአስተዳደራዊ ምርጥ መዳረሻ (top bar)"

msgid "This filter has no effect because the %module module controls access."
msgid_plural ""
"This filter has no effect because these modules control access: "
"%modules."
msgstr[0] ""
"ይህ ፍልተር ውጤት የለውም፤ %module ሞጁሉ "
"መዳረሻን ይቆጣጠራል። ይህ ፍልተር ውጤት "
"የለውም፤ እነዚህ ሞጁሎች መዳረሻን "
"ይቆጣጠራሉ፤ %modules."

msgid "Content status filter"
msgstr "የይዘት ሁኔታ ማጣሪያ"

msgid "Redundant filters detected"
msgstr "የተደጋገሙ ማጣሪያዎች ተገτοቁނል"

msgid ""
"The %view view uses the %status_filter filter but it has no effect "
"because the following module(s) control access: %modules. Review and "
"consider removing the filter."
msgid_plural ""
"The following views use the %status_filter filter but it has no effect "
"because the following module(s) control access: %modules. Review and "
"consider removing the filter from these views: @views"
msgstr[0] ""
"የ%view ዕይታ (view) የ%status_filter ማጣሪያን "
"ይጠቀማል ነገር ግን ተፅእኖ የለውም "
"ምክንያቱም የሚከተሉት ሞጁሎች (module(s)) "
"መድረስ (access) ይቆጣጠራሉ፡ %modules. "
"ማጣሪያውን ለማስወገድ ይመልከቱና ያስቡ። "
msgstr[1] ""
"%status_filter ማጣሪያን የሚጠቀሙ የሚከተሉት "
"ዕይታዎች (views) ነገር ግን ተፅእኖ የለውም "
"ምክንያቱም የሚከተሉት ሞጁሎች (module(s)) "
"መድረስ (access) ይቆጣጠራሉ፡ %modules. ከእነዚህ "
"ዕይታዎች ላይ %status_filter ማጣሪያውን "
"ለማስወገድ ይመልከቱና ያስቡ፡ @views"

msgid "Direct-write is enabled. Skipping sandboxing."
msgstr ""
"ቀጥታ መፃፍ (direct-write) ነቅቷል። "
"የሳንዳቦክሲንግን በመዝለል ላይ ነው።"

msgid ""
"Direct-write is enabled. Changes have been made to the running code "
"base."
msgstr ""
"ቀጥታ-መፃፍ (Direct-write) ንቁ ሆኗል። ለተሰራው "
"ኮድ መሰረት ላይ ለውጦች ተደርገዋል።"

msgid ""
"Direct-write mode is enabled, which means that changes will be made "
"without sandboxing them first. This can be risky and is not "
"recommended for production environments. For safety, your site will be "
"put into maintenance mode while dependencies are updated."
msgstr ""
"ቀጥታ-መጻፍ (Direct-write) ሁነታ እንደተነቃ "
"ነው፣ ማለትም ለመጀመሪያ ሳንድቦክሲንግ "
"ሳያደርጉ ለውጦቹ በቀጥታ ይደረጋሉ። ይህ "
"አደገኛ ሊሆን ይችላል እና ለምርት (production) "
"አገልግሎቶች አይመከርም። "
"ለአስተማማኝነት ሲባል ግንኙነቶች "
"(dependencies) ሲዘመኑ ጣቢያዎ ወደ ጥገና ሁነታ "
"(maintenance mode) ይቀመጣል።"

msgid "The sandbox directory is a subdirectory of the active directory."
msgstr ""
"የሳንድቦክስ ዳይሬክተሪ (sandbox) የንቁ "
"ዳይሬክተሪ (active directory) ንዑስ ዳይሬክተሪ "
"(subdirectory) ነው።"

msgid "The pg_trgm PostgreSQL extension is present."
msgstr "PostgreSQL ንጥረ ነገር (pg_trgm) ተገኝቷል።"

msgid "%profile_name (%profile%version)"
msgstr "%profile_name（%profile%version）"

msgid ""
"Drupal is unable to generate highly randomized numbers, which means "
"certain security features like password reset URLs are not as secure "
"as they should be. Instead, only a slow, less-secure fallback "
"generator is available. The most likely cause is that open_basedir "
"restrictions are in effect and /dev/urandom is not on the allowed "
"list. See the <a href=\":drupal-php\">system requirements</a> page for "
"more information. %exception_message"
msgstr ""
"Drupal የብዙ መጠን ያለው በጣም የተለያየ "
"ዘፈቀደ ቁጥሮችን ማመንጨት አይችልም፣ "
"ስለዚህ እንደ የይለፍ ቃል ዳግም "
"ማስጀመሪያ ዩአርኤል (password reset URLs) ያሉ "
"የደህንነት ባህሪዎች እንደሚገባ ያህል "
"ደህና አይደሉም። በምትኩ ቀርፋፋ የሆነ፣ "
"የተለየ ያነሰ ደህንነት ያለው ተለመደ "
"መተካት ጀነሬተር ብቻ ይገኛል። በጣም "
"የሚሆን መንስኤው ከ open_basedir ገደቦች "
"ተፈጻሚ ሆኖ የ /dev/urandom ን ወደ ፈቀደው "
"ዝርዝር አልተካተተም መሆኑ ነው። ለተጨማሪ "
"መረጃ የ <a href=\":drupal-php\">system requirements</a> "
"ገጹን ይመልከቱ። %exception_message"

msgid ""
"Update notifications are not enabled. It is <strong>highly "
"recommended</strong> that you install the Update Status module from "
"the <a href=\":module\">module administration page</a> in order to "
"stay up-to-date on new releases. For more information, <a "
"href=\":update\">Update status handbook page</a>."
msgstr ""
"የማሻሻያ ማሳወቂያዎች አልተነቃቁም። "
"አዲስ ልቀቶችን እየተከታተሉ ለመቆየት <a "
"href=\":module\">የሞጁል አስተዳደር ገጽ</a> ላይ "
"ከሚገኘው Update Status ሞጁልን መጫን <strong>በጣም "
"ይመከራል</strong>። ለበለጠ መረጃ፣ <a "
"href=\":update\">የዝማኔ ሁኔታ መመሪያ ገጽ</a>።"

msgid ""
"If you have the core Update Status module installed, in the "
"<em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Reports</em> &gt; "
"<em>Available updates</em> to see a report of the updates that are "
"available for your site software. If <em>Last checked</em> is far in "
"the past, click <em>Check manually</em> to update the report. Scan the "
"report; if the core software or any modules or themes have security "
"updates available, you should update them as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"የ core **Update Status** ሞጁል ካለዎት፣ በ "
"<em>Manage</em> አስተዳደራዊ ምናሌ ውስጥ ወደ "
"<em>Reports</em> &gt; <em>Available updates</em> ይሂዱ ለድር "
"ጣቢያዎ ሶፍትዌር የሚገኙ ዝመናዎች ሪፖርት "
"ለማየት። የ <em>Last checked</em> ሁኔታ በብዙ ጊዜ "
"በፊት ከሆነ፣ ሪፖርቱን ለማዘመን <em>Check "
"manually</em> ቁልፍን ይጫኑ። ሪፖርቱን "
"ይመርምሩ፤ የ core ሶፍትዌር ወይም ማንኛውም "
"ሞጁሎች/ተም ቅጥያዎች የደህንነት ዝመናዎች "
"ካሉ በቻሉት ፍጥነት እነሱን ማዘመን "
"አለብዎት።"

msgid ""
"Regularly review available updates and update as required to maintain "
"a secure and current site. Always run the <a "
"href=\":update-php\">update script</a> each time a module is updated. "
"Install the <a href=\":update-status\">Update Status module</a> to see "
"a report of available releases for Drupal Core and contributed modules "
"and themes."
msgstr ""
"በመደበኛነት የሚገኙ ዝመናዎችን ይመልከቱ "
"እና ደህንነቱን እና አሁናዊ መሆኑን "
"ለማረጋገጥ እንደሚፈለገው ያዘምኑ። "
"በማንኛውም ጊዜ ሞጁል ሲዘመን የተዘመነው "
"እያንዳንዱ ጊዜ <a href=\":update-php\">የዝመና "
"ስክሪፕቱን</a> ያስኬዱ። ለDrupal Core እና "
"ለተጨማሪ ሞጁሎችና ገጽታዎች የሚገኙ "
"ልቀቶች ሪፖርት ለማየት <a "
"href=\":update-status\">የዝመና ሁኔታ ሞጁል</a> "
"ይጫኑ።"

msgid "Update Status settings"
msgstr "የሁኔታ (Status) ዝርዝሮችን ያዘምኑ"

msgid ""
"The Update Status module periodically checks for new versions of your "
"site's software (including contributed modules and themes), and alerts "
"administrators to available updates. The Update Status system is also "
"used by some other modules to manage updates and downloads; for "
"example, the Interface Translation module uses the Update Status to "
"download translations from the localization server. Note that whenever "
"the Update Status system is used, anonymous usage statistics are sent "
"to Drupal.org. If desired, you may uninstall the Update Status module "
"from the <a href=\":modules\">Extend page</a>; if you do so, "
"functionality that depends on the Update Status system will not work. "
"For more information, see the <a href=\":update\">online documentation "
"for the Update Status module</a>."
msgstr ""
"የ«Update Status» (የዝመና ሁኔታ) ሞጁል "
"በየጊዜው የጣቢያዎ ሶፍትዌር አዲስ "
"ስሪቶችን ይፈትሻል (እንዲሁም የተበረከቱ "
"ሞጁሎችና ገጽታዎችን) እና ዝመናዎች ሲኖሩ "
"አስተዳዳሪዎችን ያሳውቃል። የ«Update Status» "
"ስርዓት ሌሎች አንዳንድ ሞጁሎች ዝመናዎችን "
"እና ማውረዶችን ለመቆጣጠር ይጠቀሙበታል፤ "
"ለምሳሌ፣ «Interface Translation» ሞጁል ዝመናዎች "
"ሁኔታን በመጠቀም ከማህበራዊ መገኛ "
"አገልጋይ (localization server) ላይ ትርጉሞችን "
"ያወርዳል። ሁልጊዜ የ«Update Status» ስርዓት "
"ቢጠቀም ያልተመዘገቡ (anonymous) የጠቃሚነት "
"መረጃዎች ወደ Drupal.org ይላካሉ መሆኑን "
"ይታወስ። ከፈለጉ የ«Update Status» ሞጁልን ከ <a "
"href=\":modules\">Extend page</a> ላይ ማራገፍ (uninstall) "
"ይችላሉ፤ ካደረጉ በ«Update Status» ስርዓት ላይ "
"የተመሰረቱ ተግባራት አይሰሩም። ለበለጠ "
"መረጃ ይመልከቱ፤ <a href=\":update\">የ«Update Status» "
"ሞጁል ഓንላይን ሰነዶች</a>።"

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":update-report\">Available updates report</a> displays "
"core, contributed modules, and themes for which there are new releases "
"available for download. On the report page, you can also check "
"manually for updates. You can configure the frequency of update "
"checks, which are performed during cron runs, and whether "
"notifications are sent on the <a href=\":update-settings\">Update "
"Status settings page</a>."
msgstr ""
"ከ<a href=\":update-report\">የሚገኝ የዝማኔዎች "
"ሪፖርት</a> ውስጥ ዋናውን (core) እና "
"የተበርከቱ ሞጁሎችን እንዲሁም ለማውረድ "
"የሚያስችሉ አዳዲስ ልቀቶች ያሉባቸውን "
"ጭብጦች (themes) ያሳያል። በሪፖርቱ ገጽ ላይም "
"ለዝማኔዎች በእጅ መፈተሽ ትችላለህ። "
"ዝማኔዎችን የሚፈትሹበትን የድግግሞሽ "
"መጠን (frequency) ማዋቀር ትችላለህ—እነዚህ "
"ፍተሻዎች በcron ሩጦች ወቅት "
"ይከናወናሉ—እና ማሳወቂያዎች በ<a "
"href=\":update-settings\">የዝማኔ ሁኔታ (Update Status) "
"ቅንብሮች</a> ገጽ ላይ መላክ እንደሚፈልጉ "
"መወሰን ትችላለህ።"

msgid ""
"The core User module allows users to register, log in, and log out, "
"and administrators to manage user roles and permissions. Depending on "
"which modules you have installed on your site, the related topics "
"below will help you with tasks related to managing user accounts and "
"visitors."
msgstr ""
"የዋናው የUser ሞጁል ተጠቃሚዎች "
"እንዲመዘገቡ፣ እንዲግቡ እና እንዲወጡ "
"ይፈቅዳል፤ አስተዳዳሪዎች ደግሞ የተጠቃሚ "
"ሚናዎች (user roles) እና ፈቃዶችን (permissions) "
"እንዲያስተዳድሩ ያስችላል። በድረ-ገጽዎ "
"ላይ የጫኗቸው ሞጁሎች ምን እንደሆኑ "
"በመመርኮዝ፣ ከታች ያሉት ተዛማጅ ርዕሶች "
"ስለ ተጠቃሚ መለያዎች (user accounts) እና "
"ጎብኚዎች (visitors) አስተዳደር ተያያዥ "
"ስራዎችን ለመፈጸም ይረዱዎታል።"

msgid "Table class"
msgstr "የሰንጠረዥ ክፍል (class)"

msgid "@label view mode"
msgstr "@label የእይታ ሁኔታ"

msgid "How should each row in this view be output"
msgstr ""
"ይህ በመፈለጊያው (view) ውስጥ ያለው "
"እያንዳንዱ ረድ እንዴት መውጣት (output) "
"አለበት?"

msgid ""
"If neither the row nor the style plugin supports fields, this field "
"allows to enable them, so you can for example use group by."
msgstr ""
"የረድፉም ሆነ የቅጥ ፕለጊኑ መስኮችን "
"ካልደገፉ ከሆነ፣ ይህ መስክ እንዲነቃ "
"ያስችላል፤ ለምሳሌም በቡድን ለመመደብ (group "
"by) መጠቀም ትችላለህ።"

msgid "Table CSS classes"
msgstr "የሰንጠረዥ የCSS ክፍሎች"

msgid ""
"Classes to provide on the table. Separate multiple classes with a "
"space. Example: classA classB"
msgstr ""
"በጠረጴዛው ላይ ለማቅረብ የሚያስፈልጉ "
"ክፍሎች (classes)። ብዙ ክፍሎችን ከሌላ "
"በስተቀር ለመለየት በክፍት ቦታ ይለያዩ። "
"ምሳሌ፦ classA classB"

msgid "output as"
msgstr "ውጤት እንዲሆን እንደ ሚከተለው፦"

msgid "This site is intended for demonstration purposes."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ጣቢያ ለማሳያ ዓላማዎች ብቻ የተዘጋጀ "
"ነው።"

msgid "Add component(s) to layout"
msgstr "በአቀማመጥ ውስጥ ክፍል(ዎች) ጨምር"

msgid ""
"The %field date is invalid. Date should be in the %min-%max year "
"range."
msgstr ""
"የ %field ቀን ዋጋው ትክክል አይደለም። ቀኑ በ "
"%min-%max ዓመት መካከል መሆን አለበት።"

msgid "Composer was found at %path, but could not be made read-only."
msgstr ""
"Composer በ %path ውስጥ ተገኝቷል፣ ነገር ግን "
"ሊታሸግ/ሊታሰኝ (read-only) ሊደረግ አልቻለም።"

msgid ""
"If the <code>composer</code> executable's path cannot be automatically "
"determined, you will need to add Composer to your project by running "
"the following command: <code>composer require "
"\"composer/composer:@version\"</code>:"
msgstr ""
"`composer` አፈጻጸም ፋይል (executable) መንገዱ "
"በራስ ሊወሰን ካልቻለ፣ የሚከተለውን "
"ትዕዛዝ በመፈጸም Composer ን ወደ ፕሮጀክትዎ "
"ላይ ማከል ይኖርብዎታል፦ <code>composer require "
"\"composer/composer:@version\"</code>፡"

msgid ""
"The version of the <code>composer</code> executable must satisfy "
"<code>@version</code>. See the <a href=\":url\">the Composer "
"documentation</a> for more information, or use this command to add "
"Composer to your project: <code>composer require "
"\"composer/composer:@version\"</code>"
msgstr ""
"የ<code>composer</code> አፈፃፀም ፋይል (executable) "
"ስሪት ከ<code>@version</code> ጋር መስማማት "
"አለበት። ለበለጠ መረጃ <a href=\":url\">የComposer "
"ሰነዶችን</a> ይመልከቱ፣ ወይም Composerን ወደ "
"ፕሮጀክትዎ ለማከል ይህን ትዕዛዝ ይጠቀሙ፦ "
"<code>composer require \"composer/composer:@version\"</code>"

msgid ""
"The path to Composer is set in configuration, which is no longer "
"supported. To fix this, add <code>composer/composer</code> to your "
"project's dependencies by running <code>composer require "
"'composer/composer:@version'</code>, <em>or</em> add the following "
"line to <code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_composer_path'] = "
"'@composer_path';</code>. See <a href=\":url\">this change record</a> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Composer የሚገኝበት መንገድ (path) በቅንብር "
"ውስጥ ተቀምጧል፣ ነገር ግን ይህ አሁን "
"አይደገፍም። ይህን ለመፍታት፣ <code>composer "
"require 'composer/composer:@version'</code> በመንገድ "
"በመፈጸም <code>composer/composer</code> ን ወደ "
"ፕሮጀክትዎ ጥገኛዎች (dependencies) ውስጥ "
"ያክሉ፣ <em>ወይም</em> የሚከተለውን መስመር "
"ወደ <code>settings.php</code> ያክሉ፦ "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_composer_path'] = "
"'@composer_path';</code>. ለተጨማሪ መረጃ <a "
"href=\":url\">ይህን የለውጥ መዝገብ</a> "
"ይመልከቱ።"

msgid "Path to <code>rsync</code> is configured"
msgstr "የ<code>rsync</code> የመንገድ መግለጫ ተዋቅሯል"

msgid ""
"The path to <code>rsync</code> is set in configuration, which is no "
"longer supported. To fix this, add the following line to "
"<code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_rsync_path'] = '@rsync_path';</code>. "
"See <a href=\":url\">this change record</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"<code>rsync</code> የሚገኝበት መንገድ በቅንብር "
"ውስጥ ተዘርዝሯል፣ ነገር ግን ከዚህ በኋላ "
"የሚደገፍ አይደለም። ለመፍታት ይህን "
"መስመር ወደ <code>settings.php</code> ያክሉ፦ "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_rsync_path'] = "
"'@rsync_path';</code>። ለበለጠ መረጃ <a "
"href=\":url\">ይህን የለውጥ መዝገብ</a> "
"ይመልከቱ።"

msgid ""
"A unique machine-readable name. Can only contain lowercase letters, "
"numbers, and hyphens."
msgstr ""
"ልዩ ማሽን-ሊነበብ የሚችል ስም። ትናንሽ "
"ፊደሎች፣ ቁጥሮች እና ሰረዝ (-) ብቻ ሊይዝ "
"ይችላል።"

msgid "One entity was exported to @dir."
msgid_plural "@count entities were exported to @dir."
msgstr[0] ""
"አንድ አካል ወደ @dir ተላክቷል።  @count "
"አካላት ወደ @dir ተላክተዋል።"

msgid ""
"Failed to export reference to @target_type %missing_id referenced by "
"%field on @entity_type %label because the referenced @target_type does "
"not exist."
msgstr ""
"የ@entity_type %label ላይ %field በመጠቀም "
"የተጠቀሰው @target_type %missing_id ን መላክ (export) "
"ሳይቻል፤ የተጠቀሰው @target_type አልነበረም።"

msgid "View @entity_label"
msgstr "@entity_labelን ይመልከቱ"

msgid "View @entity_bundle @entity_id"
msgstr "@entity_bundle @entity_id ን ይመልከቱ"

msgid "Maintenance mode enabled."
msgstr "የጥገና ሁኔታ ነቅቷል።"

msgid "Maintenance mode disabled."
msgstr "የጥገና ሁነታ ተዘግቷል።"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Extension is available"
msgstr "ማስፋፊያው ይገኛል"

msgid "Module '@name' is not available."
msgstr "የ '@name' ሞጁሉ አይገኝም።"

msgid "Theme '@name' is not available."
msgstr "ንድፍ «@name» አይገኝም።"

msgid "Profile '@name' is not available."
msgstr "የመገለጫ ‘@name’ አይገኝም።"

msgid "Positive or zero"
msgstr "አዎን ወይም ዜሮ"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Valid sequence keys"
msgstr "ትክክለኛ የተከታታይ ቁልፎች"

msgid "The keys of the sequence do not match the given constraints."
msgstr ""
"የተከታታዩ ቁልፎች የተሰጡትን ገደቦች "
"አይመጥኑም።"

msgid "Block Content storage body field"
msgstr "የብሎክ ይዘት ማከማቻ የአካል መስክ"

msgid "When enabled, this module adds a default block content body field."
msgstr ""
"ንቁ ሲደረግ፣ ይህ ሞጁሉ ነባሪ የብሎክ "
"ይዘት የመልእክት አካል መስክ (content body field) "
"ያክላል።"

msgid ""
"The Block Content module manages the creation, editing, and deletion "
"of content blocks. Content blocks are field-able content entities "
"managed by the <a href=\":field\">Field module</a>. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":block-content\">online documentation "
"for the Block Content module</a>."
msgstr ""
"የብሎክ ይዘት (Block Content) ሞጁሉ የይዘት "
"ብሎኮችን መፍጠር፣ ማረም እና መሰርዝ "
"ይተዳድራል። ይዘት ብሎኮች በ<a "
"href=\":field\">Field ሞጁል</a> የሚተዳደሩ "
"የመስክ-ተኮር ይዘት አካላት (field-able content "
"entities) ናቸው። ለበለጠ መረጃ፣ <a "
"href=\":block-content\">online ሰነድ ለ Block Content "
"ሞጁል</a> ይመልከቱ።"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Administer block types</em> permission can create "
"and edit block types with fields and display settings, from the <a "
"href=\":types\">Block types</a> page under the Structure menu. For "
"more information about managing fields and display settings, see the "
"<a href=\":field-ui\">Field UI module help</a> and <a "
"href=\":field\">Field module help</a>."
msgstr ""
"<em>“ብሎክ አይነቶችን ማስተዳደር”</em> "
"ፍቃድ ያላቸው ተጠቃሚዎች በ "
"<strong>የመዋቅር</strong> ምናሌ ስር ባለው <a "
"href=\":types\">“ብሎክ አይነቶች”</a> ገጽ ላይ "
"ከ<em>መስኮች</em> እና ከማሳያ ቅንብሮች ጋር "
"ብሎክ አይነቶችን መፍጠርና ማረም ይችላሉ። "
"ስለ መስኮችን እና የማሳያ ቅንብሮችን "
"አስተዳደር ለበለጠ መረጃ፣ <a "
"href=\":field-ui\">የField UI ሞጁል መርጃ</a> እና <a "
"href=\":field\">የField ሞጁል መርጃ</a> ይመልከቱ።"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Administer block content</em> or <em>Create new "
"content block</em> permissions for an individual block type are able "
"to add content blocks. These can be created on the <a "
"href=\":add-content-block\">Add content block page</a> or on the "
"<em>Place block</em> modal on the <a href=\":block-layout\">Block "
"Layout page</a> and are reusable across the entire site. Content "
"blocks created in Layout Builder for a content type or individual node "
"layouts are not reusable and also called inline blocks."
msgstr ""
"በተወሰነ የብሎክ ዓይነት ላይ <em>የብሎክ "
"ይዘት ማስተዳደር</em> ወይም <em>አዲስ የይዘት "
"ብሎክ መፍጠር</em> ፍቃዶች ያላቸው "
"ተጠቃሚዎች የይዘት ብሎኮችን ሊጨምሩ "
"ይችላሉ። እነዚህ በ <a "
"href=\":add-content-block\">የይዘት ብሎክ ጨምር "
"ገጽ</a> ላይ ወይም በ <a href=\":block-layout\">የብሎክ "
"አቀማመጥ</a> ገጽ ላይ ያለውን <em>ብሎክ "
"ማስቀመጥ</em> ሞዳል በመጠቀም ሊፈጠሩ "
"ይችላሉ እና በመላው ድረ-ገጹ ውስጥ "
"እንደገና ሊጠቀሙ ይችላሉ። በይዘት ዓይነት "
"ወይም በግለሰብ ኖድ አቀማመጦች ውስጥ በ "
"Layout Builder የተፈጠሩ የይዘት ብሎኮች ዳግመኛ "
"ሊጠቀሙ አይችሉም እና “inline blocks” "
"ተብለውም ይጠራሉ።"

msgid "Allow list style type"
msgstr "የሊስት ዓይነት (style type) ፍቀድ"

msgid "Allow the user to choose a list style type"
msgstr ""
"ተጠቃሚው የዝርዝር አይነት (list style type) "
"እንዲመርጥ ፍቀድ"

msgid ""
"Available list style types for ordered lists: letters and Roman "
"numerals instead of only numbers. Available list style types for "
"unordered lists: circles and squares instead of only discs."
msgstr ""
"የተዘረዘሩ ዝርዝሮች (ordered lists) የሚገኙ "
"ዝርዝር ዓይነቶች፡ ቁጥሮች ብቻ ሳይሆኑ "
"ፊደሎች እና ሮማን ቁጥሮች ናቸው። "
"ለማይዘረዘሩ ዝርዝሮች (unordered lists) የሚገኙ "
"ዝርዝር ዓይነቶች፡ ዲስክ (discs) ብቻ ሳይሆኑ "
"ክበቦች እና ካሬዎች ናቸው።"

msgid "Add new comment to %label"
msgstr "የ %label ላይ አዲስ አስተያየት ጨምር"

msgid "The file (%uri) associated with file entity %name does not exist."
msgstr ""
"ፋይል እትም %name ጋር የተያያዘው ፋይል (%uri) "
"አልነበረም።"

msgid ""
"The core Node, Comment, Content Block, Custom Menu Links, User, File, "
"Image, Media, and Taxonomy modules all provide content entity types."
msgstr ""
"የመሠረታዊ (core) Node፣ Comment፣ Content Block፣ Custom "
"Menu Links፣ User፣ File፣ Image፣ Media እና Taxonomy "
"ሞጁሎች ሁሉም የይዘት (content entity) "
"ዓይነቶችን ይሰጣሉ።"

msgid "Discard unsaved changes"
msgstr "ባልተቀመጡ ለውጦችን ውድቅ አድርግ"

msgid ""
"Any unsaved changes to the layout for %label will be discarded. This "
"action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"ለ %label የንድፍ ላይ ያልተቀመጡ ማንኛቸውም "
"ለውጦች ይጣላሉ። ይህ እርምጃ መተለም "
"አይቻልም።"

msgid ""
"Any unsaved changes to the layout will be discarded. This action "
"cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"የእቅዱ ላይ ያልተቀመጡ ማንኛውም ለውጦች "
"ይጣላሉ። ይህ እርምጃ መመለስ አይቻልም።"

msgid "Revert to the default layout"
msgstr "ነባር አቀማመጡን ወደ ነባር መልስ"

msgid ""
"The layout for %label will be reverted to its default state. All "
"layout modifications and inline blocks wil be reset."
msgstr ""
"%label ለውጡ የንድፍ አቀማመጥ ወደ ነባሩ "
"ሁኔታው ይመለሳል። ሁሉም የንድፍ "
"ማሻሻያዎች እና በመስመር ላይ ያሉ ብሎኮች "
"ይዳገማሉ።"

msgid ""
"The layout will be reverted to its default state. All layout "
"modifications and inline blocks will be reset."
msgstr ""
"የአቀማመጡ መዋቅር ወደ ነባሪ ሁኔታው "
"ይመለሳል። ሁሉም የአቀማመጥ ማሻሻያዎች "
"እና በመስመር ውስጥ (inline) ብሎኮች "
"ይመለሳሉ።"

msgid "Database driver for MySQLi."
msgstr "برای MySQLi داتաբेस ڈرایور."

msgid "@parent via mysqli (Experimental)"
msgstr "በ mysqli በኩል ወራሽ (ሙከራ)"

msgid ""
"The MySQLi module provides the connection between Drupal and a MySQL, "
"MariaDB or equivalent database using the mysqli PHP extension. For "
"more information, see the <a href=\":mysqli\">online documentation for "
"the MySQLi module</a>."
msgstr ""
"የMySQLi ሞዱሉሉ በPHP mysqli ቅጥያ በመጠቀም "
"Drupalን ከMySQL፣ MariaDB ወይም ከሚመሳሰል "
"የውሂብ ጎታ ጋር የሚያገናኝ ነው። ለበለጠ "
"መረጃ ይመልከቱ <a href=\":mysqli\">የMySQLi ሞዱሉሉ "
"ഓንላይን ሰነዶች</a>።"

msgid ""
"Trigger a content access permission rebuild. This can be a potentially "
"long and disruptive process."
msgstr ""
"የይዘት መዳረሻ ፈቃዶችን ዳግም መገንባት "
"(rebuild) ያንቀሳቅሱ። ይህ ሂደት ሊረዝም እና "
"ሊያስተጓጎል የሚችል ነው።"

msgid "Administer node published status"
msgstr "አስተዳዳሪ የታተመ (published) ደረጃ ይቆጣጠሩ"

msgid "Edit the published status of a node across all content types."
msgstr ""
"የታተመ ሁኔታውን በሁሉም የمحتوى "
"ዓይነቶች ላይ ላሉት ኖዶች ላይ ይቀይሩ።"

msgid "Node storage body field"
msgstr "የኖድ ማከማቻ የbody መስክ"

msgid "When enabled, this module adds a default node body field."
msgstr ""
"ንቁ ሲሆን፣ ይህ ሞጁሉ ነባሪ የnode የአካል "
"መስክ (body field) ያክላል።"

msgid ""
"The content could not be saved. Contact the site administrator if the "
"problem persists."
msgstr ""
"ይዘቱ ሊቀመጥ አልቻለም። ችግኙ ከቀጠለ "
"እባክዎ የጣቢያውን አስተዳዳሪ ያነግሩ።"

msgid ""
"%type saving node form: @message in %function (line %line of %file) "
"@backtrace_string."
msgstr ""
"%type የአገናኝ መዝጊያ ፎርም በማስቀመጥ "
"ላይ፦ @message በ %function ውስጥ (መስመር %line በ "
"%file) @backtrace_string."

msgid "Current node 'changed' time"
msgstr "የአሁኑ ኖድ ‘ተቀይሯል’ ጊዜ"

msgid "Current node 'created' time"
msgstr "የአሁኑ ኖድ “created” ጊዜ"

msgid "You must install the following module to install @module:"
msgid_plural "You must install the following modules to install @module:"
msgstr[0] ""
"@module:ን ለመጫን የሚከተሉትን ሞጁሎች መጫን "
"አለብዎት።"

msgid "You must install the following theme to install @theme:"
msgid_plural "You must install the following themes to install @theme:"
msgstr[0] ""
"@theme ን ለመጫን የሚከተሉትን ገጽታዎች (themes) "
"መጫን አለብዎት፡፡"

msgid ""
"The User module could not send an email for the operation \"%op\" "
"because the user account %account does not have an email address."
msgstr ""
"የUser ሞጁሉ ለኦፕሬሽኑ “%op” የኢሜይል "
"ማስላክ አልቻለም፤ ምክንያቱም የተጠቃሚ "
"መለያው %account የኢሜይል አድራሻ የለውም።"

msgid "The initial record number in the set."
msgstr ""
"በስብስቡ ውስጥ የመጀመሪያው መዝገብ "
"ቁጥር።"

msgid "The last record number in the set."
msgstr "በስብስቡ ውስጥ የመጨረሻው መዝገብ ቁጥር።"

msgid "The total records in the set."
msgstr ""
"የስብስቡ ውስጥ ያሉት ጠቅላላ መዛግብት "
"(records)።"

msgid "The current page number."
msgstr "የአሁኑ ገጽ ቁጥር።"

msgid "The current page record count."
msgstr "የአሁኑ ገጽ መዝገቦች ቁጥር።"

msgid "Include tokens from the first row"
msgstr "ከመጀመሪያው ረድፍ ውስጥ ቶከኖችን ያካትቱ"

msgid ""
"Enable this to use tokens from fields in the first result row, if "
"present. Global tokens (e.g., site name) and contextual argument "
"tokens are always available."
msgstr ""
"ይህን አንቃ እንዲሁም መጀመሪያው የረድፍ "
"ውጤት (first result row) ውስጥ ካሉ መስኮች "
"ተጠቃሚ ቶከኖች (tokens) ለመጠቀም። "
"የአጠቃላይ ቶከኖች (ለምሳሌ፣ የጣቢያ ስም) "
"እና የአውድ ክርክር ቶከኖች (contextual argument "
"tokens) ሁልጊዜ ይገኛሉ።"

msgid "Workspace selection handler settings"
msgstr "የዎርክስፔስ ምርጫ አስተናጋጅ ቅንብሮች"

msgid "The workspace provider to filter by."
msgstr ""
"ለመጣራት የሚያስፈልገው የዎርክስፔስ "
"አቅራቢ።"

msgid "The workspace provider."
msgstr "የስራ ቦታ አቅራቢው።"

msgid ""
"An intentionally plain theme to demonstrate and test default HTML and "
"CSS. Stark should not be used as a base theme. Instead, build a custom "
"theme using the <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/develop/theming-drupal\">Theming "
"Guide</a> as a reference."
msgstr ""
"ለውጤት እና ለማረጋገጥ የተ ఉስተናገደ "
"የግልጽ (intentionally plain) ገጽታ ነው፤ የነባር "
"HTML እና CSS እንዴት እንደሚሠራ ለማሳየት "
"ነው። Stark ን እንደ መሰረታዊ (base) ገጽታ "
"መጠቀም አይገባም። በምትኩ፣ እርስዎ "
"የራስዎን ብጁ (custom) ገጽታ ለመገንባት የ <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/develop/theming-drupal\">Theming "
"Guide</a> ን እንደ ማጣቀሻ ይጠቀሙ።"

msgid "Local files stored under a module's directory."
msgstr ""
"ከሞጁል ዳይሬክቶሪ ውስጥ የሚቀመጡ "
"የአካባቢ ፋይሎች።"

msgid "Local files stored under a theme's directory."
msgstr ""
"የአንድ ገጽታ (theme) ማውጫ ውስጥ የሚቀመጡ "
"የአካባቢ ፋይሎች።"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Sequentially validate multiple constraints"
msgstr ""
"በተከታታይ ብዙ ገደቦችን በየደረጃው "
"ያረጋግጡ"

msgid "Block content selection"
msgstr "የብሎክ ይዘት ምርጫ"

msgid "by @owner on @creation-datetime"
msgstr "@owner በ @creation-datetime ላይ"

msgid "by @owner"
msgstr "@owner በኩል"

msgid "on @creation-datetime"
msgstr "በ @creation-datetime ላይ"

msgid "Included %bundles"
msgstr "ውስጥ ያለው %bundles ተካትቷል"

msgid "Single"
msgid_plural "Limited to @count"
msgstr[0] "ነጠላ "
msgstr[1] "በ @count የተገደበ"

msgid ""
"Updates entity links with <code>data-entity-type</code> and "
"<code>data-entity-uuid</code> attributes to point to the latest entity "
"URL aliases."
msgstr ""
"አዲሱ የአካል ዩአርኤል አብዮቶችን "
"ለመጠቆም ከ<code>data-entity-type</code> እና "
"<code>data-entity-uuid</code> ባሕሪዎች ጋር የተያያዙ "
"የአካል ሊንኮችን ወደ አዲሱው የአካል "
"ዩአርኤል አብዮቶች ይዛውሩ።"

msgid "Media with link target selection"
msgstr "ለማገናኛ  hምርጫ (link target) ያለው ሚዲያ"

msgid "Administrative sidebar"
msgstr "የአስተዳደር ዳሳሽ አሞሌ"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Validate mapping as a Collection"
msgstr ""
"የካርታ ማስማማትን እንደ ኮሌክሽን "
"ማረጋገጥ"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Mark a field as optional in a Collection constraint"
msgstr ""
"በኮሌክሽን ገደብ (Collection constraint) ውስጥ "
"አንድ ፊልድ አማራጭ (optional) እንዲሆን "
"ምልክት ያድርጉ"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Mark a field as required in a Collection constraint"
msgstr ""
"በአባል-ማስገደብ (Collection constraint) ውስጥ "
"አንድ መስክ እንደ አስፈላጊ ምልክት "
"ያድርጉ"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Serialized"
msgstr "ተከታትሎ ተመዝግቦ የተዘጋጀ (Serialized)"

msgid "This value should be a serialized object."
msgstr ""
"ይህ እሴት ተመሳሳይ（serialized）ኦብጀክት "
"መሆን አለበት።"

msgid "This value should be a string, \"{type}\" given."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ዋጋ ሕብረቁምፊ (string) መሆን አለበት፣ "
"\"{type}\" የተሰጠው ነው።"

msgid ""
"The phpinfo() function is disabled. See <a href=\":url\" "
"target=\"_blank\">PHP documentation</a>."
msgstr ""
"`phpinfo()` ተግባር ተዘግቷል። ይመልከቱ <a "
"href=\":url\" target=\"_blank\">የPHP ሰነድ</a>።"

msgid ""
"Display \"@display\" needs a selected search fields to work properly. "
"See the settings for the Entity Reference Revisions list format."
msgstr ""
"“@display” እንዲሰራ በትክክል የተመረጡ "
"የፍለጋ መስኮች ያስፈልጋሉ። ለEntity Reference "
"Revisions የዝርዝር ቅርጸት መቼቶችን "
"ይመልከቱ።"

msgid ""
"Display \"@display\" uses field %field as search field, but the field "
"is no longer present. See the settings for the Entity Reference "
"Revisions list format."
msgstr ""
"«@display» ማሳያ በመፈለጊያ መስክ ምክንያት "
"የ%field መስክን ይጠቀማል፣ ነገር ግን ይህ "
"መስክ ከዚህ በኋላ አይገኝም። ለEntity Reference "
"Revisions የዝርዝር ቅርጸት ቅንብሮችን "
"ይመልከቱ።"

msgid "Entity Reference Revisions Source"
msgstr "ማስታወሻ ማጣቀሻ ቀኝ ምዝገባ ምንጭ"

msgid ""
"Allow to access to the Entity Reference Revisions orphan deletion "
"form."
msgstr ""
"የእስትኤንቲ ማጣቀሻ ማሻሻያዎች የኦርፋን "
"መሰረዣ ቅጹን መድረስ ይፍቀዱ።"

msgid ""
"Checked @entity_type revisions for orphans: @current of @total in "
"@interval (@deletions deleted)"
msgstr ""
"@entity_type የሚሰሩ ማሻሻያዎችን ለመበጣጠል "
"(orphan) ማንነቶች እየፈተሹ ነው፦ @current ከ @total "
"በ @interval ውስጥ (@deletions ተሰርዟል)"

msgid ""
"Delete orphaned composite entities revisions that are no longer "
"referenced. If there are no revisions left, the entity will be deleted "
"as long as it is not used."
msgstr ""
"ከአሁን በኋላ የማይጠቀሙባቸውን የአካል "
"ኮምፖዚት እትሮች (revisions) ይሰርዙ። ከቀሩ "
"እትሮች ካልቀሩ እስከማይጠቀሙት ድረስ "
"አካሉ ይሰረዳል።"

msgid "Select the entity types to check for orphans"
msgstr ""
"ለማፍለቅ ያልተገናኙ (orphans) የሚፈተሹትን "
"አካል ዓይነቶች ይምረጡ"

msgid "Entity Reference Revisions Orphan Purger"
msgstr ""
"የአካል ማጣቀሻ ሪቪዥኖች ተባርኪ ኦርፋን "
"ማጥፊያ"

msgid "Other (revisions)"
msgstr "ሌላ (ዳግም ስሪቶች)"

msgid "Display the label of the referenced entity revisions."
msgstr ""
"የተጣቀሱትን የአካል ማሻሻያዎች (entity "
"revisions) መለያ ስም አሳይ።"

msgid "@entity_type (revisions)"
msgstr "@entity_type (ሪቪዥኖች)"

msgid ""
"If you want to use the Field Group accordion formatter, you will need "
"to install the <a href=\":link\" target=\"_blank\">jQuery UI "
"Accordion</a> module."
msgstr ""
"Field Group accordion formatter ን ለመጠቀም ከፈለጉ፣ "
"የ <a href=\":link\" target=\"_blank\">jQuery UI Accordion</a> "
"ሞጁሉን መጫን ያስፈልግዎታል።"

msgid ""
"Fieldgroup will, as the name implies, group fields together. All "
"fieldable entities will have the possibility to add groups to wrap "
"their fields together. Fieldgroup comes with default HTML wrappers "
"like vertical tabs, horizontal tabs, fieldsets or div wrappers."
msgstr ""
"Fieldgroup ከስሙ እንደሚታወቀው መስኮችን "
"አንድ ቦታ ላይ ለመቧደን ይረዳል። ሁሉም "
"መስኮች ሊጨመሩባቸው የሚችሉ አካላት "
"(fieldable entities) መስኮቻቸውን አንድ ላይ "
"ለመጠቅለል ቡድኖች (groups) ለመጨመር እድል "
"ይኖራቸዋል። Fieldgroup በተጨማሪ እንደ "
"እርሳስ ታብስ (vertical tabs)፣ የአግድም ታብስ "
"(horizontal tabs)፣ fieldsets ወይም div wrappers ያሉ "
"የተለመዱ HTML መጠቅለያዎች (wrappers) ይዞ "
"ይመጣል።"

msgid ""
"The field group project is a follow-up on the field group module in <a "
"href=\"@link-cck\">CCK</a>. The release will only exist for Drupal 7 "
"release and higher, so since the existence of the Fields API in "
"core.</br>By moving field group to a separate module, this may open "
"some new perspectives."
msgstr ""
"የፊልድ ግሩፕ ፕሮጀክት የፊልድ ግሩፕ "
"ሞጁሉ ተከታይ ነው በ<a href=\"@link-cck\">CCK</a> "
"ውስጥ። ልቀቱ ለDrupal 7 እና ከዚያ በላይ ብቻ "
"የሚኖር ነው፤ ስለዚህም በኮር ውስጥ የFields "
"API መኖር ከሆነ።</br>ፊልድ ግሩፑን ወደ ተለየ "
"ሞጁል በማዛወር አንዳንድ አዲስ "
"አስተዋፅኦዎች ሊከፈቱ ይችላሉ።"

msgid ""
"For more information about this module feel free to visit the <a "
"href=\"@link\">module page</a>."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ሞጁሉን በበለጠ ለመረዳት እባክዎ ወደ "
"<a href=\"@link\">ሞጁል ገጹ</a> ይጎብኙ።"

msgid "Output the label as html"
msgstr "ලេබሉን HTML ලෙස ውጤት አድርጉ"

msgid "jQuery UI Accordion is deprecated"
msgstr "jQuery UI Accordion ተግባር ተቋርጧል (deprecated)"

msgid "This module is deprecated, as the Jquery UI library is EOL."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ሞጁል ተወርሷል/ተቋርጧል፣ ምክንያቱም "
"የ Jquery UI ቤተ-መጽሐፍቱ (library) መጨረሻው (EOL) "
"ላይ ስለደረሰ ነው።"

msgid "Field Group: Accordion formatter (Deprecated)"
msgstr ""
"የመስክ ቡድን፡ አኮርዲዮን ፎርማተር "
"(ተቋርጦ የተቀረ)"

msgid ""
"Provides the option to render groups as accordion. This module is "
"deprecated as Jquery UI is EOL."
msgstr ""
"ቡድኖችን እንደ አኮርዲዮን (accordion) "
"እንዲቀርቡ የሚያስችል አማራጭ ይሰጣል። "
"ይህ ሞጁል ተወዳጅነቱ ተቋርጦ (deprecated) "
"ነው፣ ምክንያቱም Jquery UI የሚያበቃ/ከዚያ "
"በኋላ የማይደገፍ (EOL) ስለሆነ።"

msgid "Accordion (Deprecated)"
msgstr "Accordion (ከተሰረዘ / የተቋረጠ)"

msgid "Accordion Item (Deprecated)"
msgstr "አкорዲየን አባል (ተቋርጧል)"

msgid "Allow HTML in label"
msgstr "ሊበቅል HTML በመለያ (label) ውስጥ ይፍቀድ።"

msgid "Allow HTML in label: @label_as_html"
msgstr "ለመለያ ውስጥ HTML ፍቀድ፡ @label_as_html"

msgid "Extra CSS classes: @classes"
msgstr "ተጨማሪ CSS ክፍሎች፦ @classes"

msgid ""
"Allows using (XSS-filtered) HTML in the label (e.g. icons). Note, that "
"some elements might not have labels by default, but that can differ "
"per theme."
msgstr ""
"ሊጠቀም የሚችል (XSS-ተጣርቶ የተዘጋጀ) HTML "
"በመለያው (label) ውስጥ (ለምሳሌ አዶዎች)። "
"አስታውስ፣ አንዳንድ አካላት በነባሪ ሁኔታ "
"መለያ (label) ሊኖራቸው አይችልም፤ ነገር ግን "
"በጭብጥ (theme) መሠረት ሊለያይ ይችላል።"

msgid "Preset accent color"
msgstr "ቅድሚያ የተወሰነ የአክሰንት ቀለም"

msgid "Preset focus color"
msgstr "ቅድሚያ የተቀመጠ የመፍጠን (focus) ቀለም"

msgid "Focus color"
msgstr "ትኩረት ቀለም"

msgid "View @bundle"
msgstr "@bundle ን ይመልከቱ"

msgid "The darkmode"
msgstr "የጨለማ ሁነታው"

msgid "Display help icon to toggle form description"
msgstr ""
"የቅንብር መግለጫውን ለመቀያየር የእርዳታ "
"አዶ ያሳዩ"

msgid ""
"This setting is overridden by the <a href=\":editUrl\">current "
"user</a>. @title: %value"
msgstr ""
"ይህ ቅንብር በ <a href=\":editUrl\">የአሁኑ "
"ተጠቃሚ</a> ተሻሽሏል። @title: %value"

msgid "Secondary toolbar in Frontend"
msgstr ""
"በፊት-ገጽ (Frontend) ላይ ያለው ሁለተኛ መሳሪያ "
"አሞሌ"

msgid "Navigation (Drupal Toolbar)"
msgstr "አሰሳ (Drupal መሳሪያ አሞሌ)"

msgid "Show Secondary Toolbar in Frontend"
msgstr ""
"በፊት ገጽ (Frontend) ላይ ሁለተኛውን መሳሪያ "
"አሞሌ አሳይ"

msgid "Show the secondary toolbar in the Frontend (when logged in to Drupal)."
msgstr ""
"Drupal ላይ የገባ ሆኖ (logged in) በFront-end ውስጥ "
"ሁለተኛውን ትር (secondary toolbar) አሳይ።"

msgid "Enable form description toggle"
msgstr "የቅጽ መግለጫ ቀያያሪን አስችል"

msgid ""
"@title <span class=\"page-title__language\">(@language "
"translation)</span>"
msgstr ""
"@title <span class=\"page-title__language\">（@language "
"translation）</span>"

msgid "Layout density"
msgstr "የንድፍ መጠን ጥግግነት"

msgid "Hide sidebar panel"
msgstr "Sidebar ፓነልን ደብቅ"

msgid "Show sidebar panel"
msgstr "የጎን ሳይድባር ፓነል አሳይ"

msgid "Close sidebar panel"
msgstr "የጎን አምድ ፓነልን ዝጋ"

msgid "Changes the layout density for tables in the admin interface."
msgstr ""
"በአስተዳዳሪ ተጠቃሚ ክፍል ውስጥ "
"ለሰንጠረዦች የንድፍ ጥግግትን ይቀይራል።"

msgid "Custom Focus color"
msgstr "ብጁ የፎከስ ቀለም"

msgid "Increase contrast"
msgstr "የተቃራኒነት መጨመር"

msgid "Create Navigation"
msgstr "አሰሳ ፍጠር"

msgid "Content Navigation"
msgstr "የمحتوا አሰሳ"

msgid "New Drupal Navigation, Test integration"
msgstr ""
"አዲስ የDrupal አስጀማሪ አሰሳ (Navigation)፣ "
"የሙከራ ውህደት"

msgid "Top Menus"
msgstr "የላይኛው ምናሌዎች"

msgid "Sticky action buttons"
msgstr "የቋሚ እርምጃ አዝራሮች"

msgid ""
"This setting is currently deactivated as it is overwritten by the "
"navigation module."
msgstr ""
"ይህ መቼት አሁን ተጠፍቷል (inactive) ያለው "
"እንደሆነ ምክንያቱ በአሰሳ (navigation) ሞጁል "
"እንዲተተካ ስለሚደረግ ነው።"

msgid "Enable sticky action buttons"
