msgid "Example: Variant: Segments"
msgstr "ምሳሌ፡ ቫሪያንት፡ ክፍሎች"

msgid "An example of a long/short form with organization variants."
msgstr ""
"የዕድሉ/አጭር ቅጽ ረጅም-አጭር ምሳሌ "
"ከድርጅት ልዩነቶች ጋር።"

msgid "Long form"
msgstr "ረጅም ቅርጽ"

msgid "Short form"
msgstr "አጭር ቅጽ"

msgid "Hello Organization A!!!"
msgstr "የእንኳን ደህና መጡ ድርጅት ኤ!!!"

msgid "Hello Organization B!!!"
msgstr "ሰላም ድርጅት ቢ!!!"

msgid "Hello Organization C!!!"
msgstr "እንኳን ደህና መጡ የ C!!! ድርጅት!!!"

msgid ""
"Demonstrates how to use the Webform module to build an "
"application/evaluation system."
msgstr ""
"የበድዌብፎርም (Webform) ሞጁሉን በመጠቀም "
"የአመልካች/ግምገማ ስርዓት እንዴት "
"እንደሚገነባ ያሳያል።"

msgid ""
"Demonstrates how to use the Webform module to build an event "
"registration system with email reminders."
msgstr ""
"የኢሜይል ማስታወሻዎች ጋር የዝግጅት "
"ምዝገባ ስርዓት ለመገንባት Webform ሞጁሉን "
"እንዴት እንደሚጠቀሙ ያሳያል።"

msgid ""
"Demonstrates how to use the Webform module to build a region based "
"contact system."
msgstr ""
"የ Webform ሞጁልን ተጠቅሞ በክልል መሰረት "
"የተደራጀ የግንኙነት ስርዓት እንዴት "
"እንደሚገነባ ያሳያል።"

msgid "Form API Export"
msgstr "የቅጽ ኤፒአይ ማውጫ"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Form API export</strong> page demonstrates how a webform's "
"elements may be used to create custom configuration forms."
msgstr ""
"<strong>የቅጽ ኤፒአይ ኤክስፖርት</strong> ገጽ "
"የዌብፎርም ክፍሎቹ (elements) እንዴት እንደ "
"ተለመደ የቅንብር ቅጾች ለመፍጠር "
"እንደሚጠቅሙ ያሳያል።"

msgid "Form API (FAPI) Code"
msgstr "የፎርም ኤፒአይ (FAPI) ኮድ"

msgid "Module info"
msgstr "Module መረጃ"

msgid "Configuration settings form"
msgstr "የቅንብር መቀበያ ገጽ"

msgid "Webform Custom Form Example"
msgstr "ዌብፎርም የተበጁ ፎርም ምሳሌ"

msgid ""
"Provides an example of custom configuration form built using the "
"Webform module."
msgstr ""
"የ Webform ሞጁልን ተጠቅሞ የተገነባ ብጁ "
"የቅንብር ቅጽ ምሳሌ ይሰጣል።"

msgid "Example: Webform Custom (Configuration) Form"
msgstr "ምሳሌ፡ የዌብፎርም ባስተማሪ (ውቅር) ፎርም"

msgid ""
"The below custom properties are provided and managed by the "
"webform_example_element_properties.module."
msgstr ""
"ქვემოთ მოცემული "
"მორგებული თვისებები "
"უზრუნველყოფილია და "
"მართება webform_example_element_properties.module ૽ "
"દ્વારા."

msgid ""
"The custom data value will be added to @label (@type) data-* "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"የተበጁ መረጃ ዋጋው ወደ @label (@type) የ data-* "
"ባህሪዎች ይጨመራል።"

msgid "Webform Element Properties Example"
msgstr "የWebform ኤለመንት ባህሪዎች ምሳሌ"

msgid ""
"Provides an example that shows how to add custom properties to Webform "
"elements."
msgstr ""
"የWebform አካሎች ላይ ተጨማሪ ባህሪያት (custom "
"properties) እንዴት እንደሚጨምሩ ምሳሌ "
"ያቀርባል።"

msgid "Immediately send email when testing a webform"
msgstr ""
"የድር ፎርምን ሲፈትሹ ፈጥነው ኢሜይል "
"ይላኩ"

msgid "Use UUIDs for all entity references"
msgstr ""
"ሁሉንም የአካል ማጣቀሻዎች ለመጠቀም UUID "
"ይጠቀሙ"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Config Export</strong> form allows developers to quickly "
"export a single webform's YAML configuration file."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Config Export</strong> ፎርሙ የድረ ገጽ ቅጽ "
"(webform) አንድ ብቻ የYAML ቅንብር ፋይልን "
"በፍጥነት ለመላክ (export) ለገንቢዎች "
"ያስችላቸዋል።"

msgid "Enter a number range (1:100)"
msgstr "ክልል ያለው ቁጥር ያስገቡ (1:100)"

msgid ""
"The '@instance_id' variant id is missing for the '@title (@key)' "
"variant type. <strong>No variant settings have been applied.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"የ“@title (@key)” የተለዋዋጭ አይነት ውስጥ "
"“@instance_id” የተለዋዋጭ መታወቂያ (variant id) "
"ጠፍቷል። <strong>ምንም የተለዋዋጭ ቅንብሮች "
"አልተተገበሩም።</strong>"

msgid ""
"Automatically save as draft when paging, previewing, and when there "
"are validation errors"
msgstr ""
"በማሸብለል (pagination)፣ በቅድሚያ ማሳየት "
"(previewing) እና የተሳሳተ ማረጋገጫ ስህተቶች "
"ሲኖሩ ራስ በራስ እንደ ረቂቅ በማስቀመጥ "
"ላይ"

msgid ""
"Automatically save partial submissions when users click the \"Next "
"Page\", \"Previous Page\", or \"Preview\" buttons or when validation "
"errors prevent a webform from being submitted."
msgstr ""
"ተጠቃሚዎች “Next Page” (ቀጣይ ገጽ)፣ “Previous "
"Page” (ቀዳሚ ገጽ) ወይም “Preview” (ቅድመ "
"እይታ) የሚሉትን ቁልፎች ሲጫኑ ወይም "
"የማረጋገጫ ስህተቶች የዌብፎርሙን "
"እንዳይቀርብ ሲያግዱት ከፊል አቅርቦቶችን "
"በራስ ሰር ማስቀመጥ።"

msgid "Enable the %name variant"
msgstr "የ %name ተለዋጭ (variant) አግብር"

msgid "Login message when access denied to private file uploads"
msgstr ""
"የግብዣ መልእክት ፋይል ግላዊ ሆኖ ሲገባ "
"መከልከል ሲደረግ (የመግባት መልእክት)"

msgid ""
"Setting autocomplete to off will disable autocompletion for this "
"element. Select 'Autofill' to use semantic attribute values for "
"collecting certain types of user information."
msgstr ""
"«Авቶకом플ීթ» እንዳይሰራ ማድረግ በዚህ "
"አካል ላይ ለሚከናወን አውቶማቲክ ማሟያ "
"መስክ ይዘጋል። አንድ ዓይነት የተጠቃሚ "
"መረጃ ለመሰብሰብ ‹Autofill› ን ምረጥ፣ ይህም "
"በሴማንቲክ አትሪቡት (semantic attribute) እሴቶች "
"ይጠቀማል።"

msgid "Autofill…"
msgstr "خودሰርቶ ሙላ…"

msgid "Autocomplete autofill"
msgstr "አውቶקಂಪਲੀټ አውቶፊል"

msgid ""
"Browsers sometimes have features for helping users fill forms in, for "
"example prefilling the user's address based on earlier user input. The "
"autocomplete (autofill) attribute can be used to hint to the user "
"agent how to, or indeed whether to, provide such a feature."
msgstr ""
"አሳሾች  bመቼ ተጠቃሚዎች ቅጾችን እንዲሞሉ "
"ለመርዳት የሚችሉ ባህሪያት አላቸው፤ "
"ለምሳሌ አስቀድሞ ተጠቃሚው ያስገባው መረጃ "
"ላይ ተመስርቶ የተጠቃሚውን አድራሻ "
"በቅድሚያ ሊሞሉ (prefill) ይችላሉ። የ autocomplete "
"(autofill) ባህሪ (attribute) የተጠቃሚ "
"አေးርስ/ወኪል (user agent) ይህን እንዴት "
"እንደሚሰጥ፣ ወይም በእርግጥ ይህን ባህሪ "
"መስጠት እንደሚገባው እንዲያስጠነቅቅ "
"ምክር ለመስጠት ሊያገለግል ይችላል።"

msgid "Biographical attributes"
msgstr "የሕይወት ታሪክ ባህሪዎች"

msgid "Honorific prefix"
msgstr "ክብር ቅድመ-ስም"

msgid "Additional names"
msgstr "ተጨማሪ ስሞች"

msgid "Honorific suffix"
msgstr "የክብር ቅጥያ"

msgid "Organization job title"
msgstr "የድርጅት የስራ ርዕስ"

msgid "Birthday day"
msgstr "የልደት ቀን"

msgid "Birthday month"
msgstr "የልደት ወር"

msgid "Birthday year"
msgstr "የልደት ዓመት"

msgid "Contact photo"
msgstr "የተገናኛ ፎቶ"

msgid "Instant messaging URL"
msgstr "የፈጣን መልዕክት ዩአርኤል"

msgid "Address attributes"
msgstr "የመቀመጫ አትሪቢውቶችን ያድርጉ"

msgid "Street address (multiline)"
msgstr "የመኖሪያ አድራሻ (ብዙ መስመሮች)"

msgid "Address level 1"
msgstr "የ1ኛ ደረጃ አድራሻ"

msgid "Address level 2"
msgstr "የአድራሻ ደረጃ 2"

msgid "Address level 3"
msgstr "የአድራሻ ደረጃ 3"

msgid "Address level 4"
msgstr "የአድራሻ ደረጃ 4"

msgid "Postal code / Zip code"
msgstr "የፖስታ ኮድ / ዚፕ ኮድ"

msgid "Telephone attributes"
msgstr "የስልክ ባህሪዎች"

msgid "Telephone - home"
msgstr "ስልክ - ቤት"

msgid "Telephone - work"
msgstr "ስልክ - ሥራ"

msgid "Telephone - work extension"
msgstr "ስልክ - የሥራ ማስፈንጠሪያ"

msgid "Telephone - mobile"
msgstr "ስልክ －  მንቀሳቃሽ"

msgid "Telephone - fax"
msgstr "ስልክ  - ፋክስ"

msgid "Telephone - pager"
msgstr "ስልክ - ፔጅር"

msgid "Telephone country code"
msgstr "የስልክ አገር ኮድ"

msgid "Telephone national code"
msgstr "የስልክ ብሔራዊ ኮድ"

msgid "Telephone area code"
msgstr "የስልክ አካባቢ ኮድ"

msgid "Telephone local number"
msgstr "የአካባቢ ስልክ ቁጥር"

msgid "Telephone local prefix"
msgstr "የአካባቢ ስልክ አካባቢ ቅድመ ቁጥር"

msgid "Telephone local suffix"
msgstr "የአካባቢ የስልክ መጨረሻ ቅጥያ (suffix)"

msgid "Telephone extension"
msgstr "የስልክ አቅራቢ ቅጥያ (ኤክስቴንሽን)"

msgid "Commerce attributes"
msgstr "ንግድ ባህሪያት"

msgid "Additional names on card"
msgstr "በካርዱ ላይ የተጨማሪ ስሞች"

msgid "Family name on card"
msgstr "የካርዱ ላይ ያለው የቤተሰብ ስም"

msgid "Allow users to sort elements"
msgstr ""
"ተጠቃሚዎች አካላትን እንዲያስተካክሉ "
"ይፍቀድ።"

msgid "Allow users to add/remove elements"
msgstr ""
"ব্যবহারকারীরা እቃዎችን "
"መጨመር/መለወጥ እንዲችሉ ፍቀድ"

msgid "Allow users to input the number of items to be added"
msgstr ""
"ተጠቃሚዎች ሊታከሉ የሚገቡትን እቃዎች "
"ብዛት እንዲገቡ ፍቀድ"

msgid ""
"Delete existing submissions in specified webform before generating new "
"submissions"
msgstr ""
"በሚፈጠሩ አዳዲስ ግብአቶች በፊት "
"በተገለጸው ዌብፎርም ውስጥ ያሉ ነባር "
"እስገቦችን ሰርዝ።"

msgid "Date placeholder"
msgstr "ቀን ማስቀመጫ ቦታ"

msgid "Time placeholder"
msgstr "የጊዜ እስታሚ (Placeholder)"

msgid "Always include elements with private and restricted access"
msgstr ""
"ሁልጊዜ የግል እና ገደብ የተጣለባቸው "
"መደረጃዎችን (ኤለመንቶችን) ያካትቱ።"

msgid "Demo: Events"
msgstr "ዴሞ፦ ክስተቶች"

msgid ""
"An example of a custom (configuration) form built using the webform "
"module."
msgstr ""
"webform ሞጁልን በመጠቀም የተሰራ ብጁ "
"(configuration) ፎርም ምሳሌ።"

msgid ""
"If checked, the exported file and any submission file uploads will be "
"download in the archive file."
msgstr ""
"በእሱ ከተመረጠ (Checked)፣ የተላከው ፋይል "
"እና ማንኛውም የማስገቢያ ፋይል ቅበላዎች "
"በአርኪቭ ፋይሉ ውስጥ ሆነው ይወርዳሉ።"

msgid "Archive options"
msgstr "የማህደር አማራጮች"

msgid "Archive file type"
msgstr "መዝገብ ፋይል አይነት"

msgid ""
"Select the archive file type for submission file uploads and generated "
"documents."
msgstr ""
"ለበጎታ ፋይል ከሚያስገቡት እና ለተፈጠሩ "
"ሰነዶች የመላኪያ ፋይል አይነት (archive) "
"ይምረጡ።"

msgid "Tar archive (*.tar.gz)"
msgstr "ታር արՆይቭ (*.tar.gz)"

msgid "ZIP file (*.zip)"
msgstr "ZIP ፋይል (*.zip)"

msgid "Return/default value"
msgstr "ነባሪ/መመለሻ እሴት ይመለስ"

msgid ""
"The return value is what is submitted to the server and stored in the "
"database when the element is checked. The default value and "
"recommended return value is a TRUE boolean value."
msgstr ""
"የመመለሻ ዋጋው ንጥሉ (element) ሲፈትሽ ወደ "
"አገልጋዩ የሚላከውና በዳታቤዝ ውስጥ "
"የሚቀመጠው ነው። ነባሪው ዋጋና የተመከረው "
"መመለሻ ዋጋ የ TRUE ቦይሊያን (boolean) ዋጋ "
"መሆን አለበት።"

msgid ""
"<strong>The return value should only be customized when an external "
"system or service expects a custom string value. (i.e. yes, checked, "
"accepted, etc…)</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>የመመለሻ እሴቱ አንድ ውጫዊ ስርዓት "
"ወይም አገልግሎት ልዩ የጽሑፍ እሴት "
"(ማለትም፡ yes, checked, accepted ወዘተ…) "
"እንዲጠበቅ ሲያስፈልግ ብቻ "
"እንደሚያስፈልግ መቀየር አለበት።</strong>"

msgid "Boolean limit"
msgstr "ቡሊያን ገደብ"

msgid "Options limits"
msgstr "የአማራጮች ገደቦች"

msgid "Please add a new options or checkbox element."
msgstr ""
"ദയവായി 새로운 옵션 അല്ലെങ്കിൽ "
"চेकবോക്സ് എലമെന്റ് "
"ઉમാറിക്കുക."

msgid "No options or checkbox elements are available."
msgstr ""
"هیچ አማራጭ ወይም መራጮች (checkbox) አካሎች "
"አይገኙም።"

msgid "@title @type limit"
msgstr "@title @type ገደብ"

msgid "This message will be displayed when all limits are reached."
msgstr ""
"ይህ መልእክት ሁሉም ገደቦች ተሟግተው "
"ሲደርሱ ይታያል።"

msgid "Apply limits to each source entity"
msgstr ""
"ለእያንዳንዱ የምንጭ አካል ላይ ገደቦችን "
"ያስተናግዱ"

msgid "Apply limits to per user"
msgstr "በተጠቃሚያችን ላይ ገደቦችን ተግብር"

msgid ""
"If checked, limits will be applied per submission for authenticated "
"and anonymous users. Anonymous user limits are only tracked by the "
"user's browser sessions. Per user limits work best for authenticated "
"users."
msgstr ""
"ከተፈቀደ ፣ ገደቦቹ በማረጋገጥ እና "
"በማይረጋገጡ (anonymous) ተጠቃሚዎች ላይ "
"በእያንዳንዱ ግብአት (submission) መሠረት "
"ይተገበራሉ። የማይረጋገጡ ተጠቃሚዎች "
"ገደቦች የሚከታተሉት በተጠቃሚው የአሳሽ "
"ሰቀሻ (browser session) ብቻ ነው። በተጠቃሚ "
"መሠረት የሚሰሩ ገደቦች ለማረጋገጥ ላይ "
"(authenticated) ተጠቃሚዎች በጣም ይሻላሉ።"

msgid "Do not alter the option/checkbox"
msgstr "አማራጭ/ቼክቦክሱን ምንም ነገር አትቀይር።"

msgid "Append message to the option/checkbox's text"
msgstr ""
"የአማራጭ/ቼክቦክስ ጽሑፍ መጨረሻ ላይ "
"መልዕክት ያክሉ"

msgid "Append message to the option/checkbox's description"
msgstr ""
"پیغامን ወደ አማራጭ/ቼክቦክስ መግለጫው "
"ላይ አክል።"

msgid "Multiple remaining message"
msgstr "ብاقዩ የቀሩ መልዕክቶች ብዙ (በብዙ ቁጥር)"

msgid "Unlimited message"
msgstr "የማያልቅ መልእክት"

msgid ""
"@limit - The total number of submissions allowed for the "
"option/checkbox."
msgstr ""
"@limit - ለአማራጭ/ምርጫ ሳጥኑ የተፈቀደ "
"የማስገቢያዎች አጠቃላይ ብዛት።"

msgid "@total - The current number of submissions for the option/checkbox."
msgstr ""
"@total - ለአማራጭ/ቼክቦክስ ያለው የአሁኑ "
"የገቢዎች ብዛት።"

msgid ""
"@remaining - The remaining number of submissions for the "
"option/checkbox."
msgstr ""
"@remaining - ለአማራጭ/ቼክቦክስ የቀሩት  "
"സമዎች ብዛት።"

msgid "@label - The element option/checkbox's label."
msgstr ""
"@label - የኤለመንት አማራጭ/ቼክቦክስ የመለያ "
"ስያሜ (label)።"

msgid "Options/Checkbox limit"
msgstr "የአማራጮች/ቼክቦክስ ገደብ"

msgid "Per source entity"
msgstr "የመነሻ አካል (source entity) እንደሆነ"

msgid "Reusing Webform APIs"
msgstr "የ Webform ኤፒአይ በድጋሚ መጠቀም"

msgid ""
"This screencast walks through how to reusing the Webform module’s "
"APls to create custom configuration forms."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ስክሪንካስት የ Webform ሞጁሉን የ API "
"ዎችን እንዴት በመጠቀም ተለያዩ የማዋቀር "
"(configuration) ቅጾችን እንደሚፈጠሩ ያብራራል።"

msgid ""
"A single webform's YAML configuration file can easily be <a "
"href=\":href\">imported</a> into another Drupal instance."
msgstr ""
"አንድ የነጠላ ዌብፎርም የYAML ውቅር ፋይል "
"በቀላሉ <a href=\":href\">ወደ ሌላ ድሩፓል "
"ኢንስታንስ ሊገባ ይችላል</a>።"

msgid "Allow users to customize the submission results table"
msgstr ""
"ተጠቃሚዎች የአቀራረብ ውጤቶች ሰንጠረዥን "
"እንዲያበጁ ፍቀድ"

msgid ""
"If checked, users can customize the submission results table for this "
"webform."
msgstr ""
"اگر انتخاب شود፣ ተጠቃሚዎች ለዚህ ድር "
"ቅጽ (webform) የመግቢያ ውጤቶች ሠንጠረዥን "
"ማበጀት (customize) ይችላሉ።"

msgid "My table settings"
msgstr "የእኔ የጠረጴዛ ቅንብሮች"

msgid "Default table settings"
msgstr "የነባሪ ሠንጠረዥ ቅንብሮች"

msgid ""
"If checked, users can individually customize the submission results "
"table for all webforms."
msgstr ""
"ከተነቃ ተጠቃሚዎች ለሁሉም የዌብፎርሞች "
"የአቀራረብ ውጤቶች ሰንጠረዥን በግል "
"ሊያበጁ ይችላሉ።"

msgid ""
"Validation error message contains HTML markup. HTML markup can not be "
"display via HTML5 clientside validation and will be removed."
msgstr ""
"የማረጋገጫ ስህተት መልእክት ውስጥ የHTML "
"ማርክፕ ይዟል። የHTML ማርክፕ በHTML5 የጎን "
"መስመር (client-side) ማረጋገጫ በኩል ሊታይ "
"አይችልም እና ይወገዳል።"

msgid "Table select header"
msgstr "የጠረጴዛ ምርጫ ራስጌ"

msgid "Table select description header"
msgstr "የሰንጠረዥ ምርጫ መግለጫ ራስጌ"

msgid ""
"The label is displayed in the header for the table select's option "
"limit column."
msgstr ""
"ලේබලය የሰንጠረዥ ምርጫ (table select) "
"የአማራጭ ገደብ አምድ ላይ ለሚታየው ራስጌ "
"ውስጥ ይታያል።"

msgid "Add <span>row</span>"
msgstr "<span>ረድ</span> ተጨምር"

msgid "Add <span>element</span>"
msgstr "<span>ኤለመንት</span> ጨምር"

msgid "Element keys are automatically prefixed with parent row's key."
msgstr ""
"የኤለመንት ቁልፎች በራስ ሰር ከወላጅ ረድ "
"ቁልፍ ጋር ተቀድሞ ይታከላሉ።"

msgid ""
"The %title (@type) must be with in a %parent_title (@parent_type) "
"element."
msgstr ""
"%title (@type) እባክዎ %parent_title (@parent_type) ውስጥ "
"ይኖር ዘንድ አስፈላጊ ነው።"

msgid "Webform Composites vs. Tables"
msgstr "ዌብፎርም ኮምፖዚትስ ከ ታብሎች ጋር"

msgid ""
"This screencast walks through when to use a webform composite element "
"and when to use a webform table."
msgstr ""
"මෙම screencast በድር ቅጽ (webform) ውስጥ composite "
"ክፍል (composite element) መጠቀም መቼ እንደሚገባ "
"እና የ webform table መጠቀም መቼ እንደሚሻል "
"ያብራራል።"

msgid ""
"The %webform webform is <a href=\":href\">closed</a>. The below status "
"will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"የ %webform ዌብፎርሙ እርስዎ እንዲያሰሩት "
"የታሸገ ነው (<a href=\":href\">closed</a>). ከዚች "
"በታች ያለው ሁኔታ ተተው ይታሰባል "
"(አይከተልም)።"

msgid ""
"The %webform webform is <strong>closed</strong>. The below status will "
"be ignored."
msgstr ""
"%webform የሚታየው ዌብፎርም "
"<strong>ተዘግቷል</strong>። ከታች ያለው ሁኔታ "
"ችላ ይባላል።"

msgid "Checklist (☑/☐)"
msgstr "የምርመራ ዝርዝር (☑/☐)"

msgid "Checklist (gi)"
msgstr "የፍተሻ ዝርዝር (ጂአይ)"

msgid ""
"Enter a <a href=\":href\">regular expression</a> that the element's "
"value should match."
msgstr ""
"ኤለመንቱ ዋጋው ሊዛመድ የሚገባውን <a "
"href=\":href\">መደበኛ መግለጫ (regular expression)</a> "
"ያስገቡ።"

msgid ""
"If checked, adds required indicator to the title, if visible. To "
"required individual elements, also tick \"Required\" under the @name "
"settings above."
msgstr ""
"በምልክት ከተደረገ፣ ታይ ከሆነ ርዕስ (title) "
"ላይ የሚያስፈልግ አመልካች (required indicator) "
"ያክላል። ለየብል ክፍሎችም እንዲሁ ከላይ "
"ባለው @name አቀናባሪ (settings) ስር ያለውን "
"“Required” የሚለውን ደግሞ ያሳምሩ (tick)።"

msgid "Scale settings"
msgstr "የመጠን ማስተካከያ ቅንጅቶች"

msgid "Minimum label"
msgstr "ቢመረጡ የሚችል ዝቅተኛ መለያ"

msgid "Maximum label"
msgstr "ከፍተኛ መለያ"

msgid "Label for the maximum value in the scale."
msgstr "የመለኪያው ከፍተኛ እሴት መለያ ስም።"

msgid "Scale size"
msgstr "አቅም መጠንን ቀይር"

msgid "Scale type"
msgstr "የመጠን አይነት"

msgid "Scale text"
msgstr "ጽሑፍን አስፋ (Scale text)"

msgid "Provides a form element for input of a numeric scale."
msgstr ""
"ቁمیጥ መለኪያ እሴት ለመግባት "
"የሚያገለግል የቅጽ (form) አካል ይሰጣል።"

msgid "Header attributes"
msgstr "ራስጌ ባህሪዎች"

msgid "Header attributes (YAML)"
msgstr "ራስጌ (Header) ባህሪዎች (YAML)"

msgid ""
"If checked, the table's header will remain visible as the user scrolls "
"through the table."
msgstr ""
"ከታች እንደተመረጠ (checked) ከሆነ፣ ተጠቃሚው "
"ሰንጠረዡን ሲያሸብልል የሰንጠረዡ ራስ "
"(header) ክፍሉ ተደራሽ ሆኖ ይቆያል።"

msgid ""
"If checked, all rows and elements within the table will be prefixed "
"with the table's element key and a  incremented numeric value. (i.e. "
"table_01_first_name)"
msgstr ""
"ካረጋገጠ ፣ በሰንጠረዡ ውስጥ ያሉት ሁሉም "
"ረድፎች እና ክፍሎች የሰንጠረዡ ክፍል "
"ቁልፍ (element key) እና የተጨመረ ቁጥር ዋጋ "
"በፊት ይታያሉ። (ማለትም: table_01_first_name)"

msgid ""
"If checked, adds required indicator to the title, if visible. To "
"require individual elements, also tick \"Required\" under each "
"elements settings."
msgstr ""
"اگر علامت‌گذاری شود، اگر እየታየ ከሆነ "
"ርዕሱ ላይ የሚፈለግ መለያ (required indicator) "
"ያክላል። ነጠላ ክፍሎችን ለመፈለግ ደግሞ "
"በእያንዳንዱ ክፍል መቼቶች ስር “Required” "
"የሚለውን አማራጭ እንዲሁ ምልክት ያድርጉ።"

msgid "Row keys are the tables's key with an incremented value."
msgstr ""
"የረድፍ ኮዶች የሰንጠረዡ ቁልፍ ሲሆን "
"በተጨማሪ የተጨመረ እሴት (incremented value) "
"ይዘጋጃሉ።"

msgid "Duplicate the table's first row"
msgstr ""
"Дuplicate the table's first row -> таблицаው "
"የመጀመሪያ ረድፍን ደግም ያባዝ (ቅጂ) "
"ያድርጉ"

msgid "Table row"
msgstr "የጠረጴዛ መስመር"

msgid "Provides an element to render a table row."
msgstr ""
"የ పట్టል ረድ ለማሳየት አንድ ክፍል "
"(ኤለመንት) ይሰጣል።"

msgid "@title contains an invalid signature."
msgstr "@title የማይሆን ፊርማ ይይዛል።"

msgid "not valid"
msgstr "ዋጋዊ (valid) አይደለም"

msgid ""
"<a "
"href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input#attr-disabled\">Disabled</a> "
"elements do not submit data back to the server and the element's "
"server-side default or current value will be preserved and saved to "
"the database."
msgstr ""
"`Disabled` የተደረጉ ኤለመንቶች ወደ አገልጋዩ "
"መልስ ዳታ (data) አይሰጡም፣ እንዲሁም "
"የኤለመንቱ በአገልጋይ ያለው ነባሪ (server-side "
"default) ወይም ያሁኑ ዋጋ ይጠበቅ ተቆጥሮ ወደ "
"ዳታቤዙ ይቀመጣል።"

msgid ""
"The <a "
"href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Geolocation_API\">HTML "
"Geolocation API</a> is used to get the geographical position of a "
"user. Since this can compromise privacy, the position is not available "
"unless the user approves it."
msgstr ""
"የ <a "
"href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Geolocation_API\">HTML "
"Geolocation API</a> ተጠቃሚ አንድን ቦታ ቦታዊ "
"አቀማመጥ (geographical position) ለመለየት "
"ይጠቅማል። ይህ የግላዊነት ሁኔታን ሊጎዳ "
"ስለሚችል፣ ቦታው ተጠቃሚው እስኪፈቅድ "
"ድረስ አይገኝም።"

msgid "Cast posted element value and custom data"
msgstr ""
"የተለጠፈውን አካል ዋጋ እና ተለያዩ "
"መረጃዎችን (custom data) አስረክብ/ተመዝግብ"

msgid ""
"If checked, posted element values will be cast to integers, floats, "
"and booleans as needed. Custom data can be cast by placing the desired "
"type in parentheses before the value or token. (i.e. \"(int) "
"[webform_submission:value:total]\" or \"(int) 100\")"
msgstr ""
"ከተመረጠ ፣ የተለጠፉ አካል ዋጋዎች "
"እንደሚፈለገው ኢንቲጀሮች (integers)፣ ፍሎቶች "
"(floats) እና ቡሊያን (booleans) ወደ ሚገባቸው "
"ይቀየራሉ። ብጁ ውሂብ በመፈለገው ዓይነት "
"(type) በዋጋው ወይም ቶከኑ ፊት በቅንፍ "
"(parentheses) በመጨመር መቀየር ይቻላል፣ "
"ማለትም (ለምሳሌ) “(int) "
"[webform_submission:value:total]” ወይም “(int) 100”።"

msgid "For custom data, the casts allowed are:"
msgstr ""
"ለተቀየሰ ውሂብ የተፈቀዱ የመቀየሪያ "
"ዓይነቶች (casts)፦"

msgid "@cast - cast to @type"
msgstr "@cast - @type ላይ መቀየር"

msgid "This message is displayed when the response status code is not 2xx."
msgstr ""
"ይህ መልእክት የምላሹ ሁኔታ (response status) ኮድ "
"2xx ካልሆነ ሲታይ ነው።"

msgid "Custom response messages"
msgstr "ብጁ ምላሽ መልዕክቶች"

msgid "201 Created"
msgstr "201 ፈጥኖ ተፈጠረ"

msgid "204 No Content"
msgstr "204 ይዘት የለም"

msgid "Post type:"
msgstr "የልጥፍ አይነት፦"

msgid "Type casting:"
msgstr "ዓይነት መቀየር፦"

msgid "Share embed"
msgstr "Embedን ያጋሩ"

msgid "Share preview"
msgstr "ප್ರೀוችን አጋራ/ቅድመ እይታ አጋራ"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Share preview</strong> page allows site builders to "
"preview an embedded webform."
msgstr ""
"<strong>የቅድመ እይታ መጋራት</strong> ገጹ "
"የጣቢያ ገንቢዎች የተካተተ የድረ-ገጽ ቅጽ "
"(webform) ቅድመ እይታ እንዲያደርጉ "
"ያስችላቸዋል።"

msgid "Share test"
msgstr "የሙከራ ማጋራት"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Share test</strong> page allows site builders to test an "
"embedded webform."
msgstr ""
"<strong>የሙከራ ማጋራት</strong> ገጹ የጣቢያ "
"ገንቢዎች ተካትቶ የተዋቀረ የድር ፎርምን "
"ለመፈተሽ እንዲችሉ ያስችላል።"

msgid "JavaScript -- The embedded webform will be inserted using JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"JavaScript — የውስጥ የဝెብፎርሙን የሚገባው "
"በ JavaScript በመጠቀም ይሆናል።"

msgid "Fixed iframe code"
msgstr "የተስተካከለ iframe ኮድ"

msgid "Copy code"
msgstr "کೋपी код"

msgid "Share settings"
msgstr "የማጋራት ቅንብሮች"

msgid "Form sharing enabled for webform nodes"
msgstr "ለዌብፎርም ኖዶች የቅርሽ መጋራት ተቻሏል"

msgid "Form sharing is enabled for all webforms node."
msgstr ""
"የቅጽ ማጋራት ለሁሉም የድር ቅጾች (webforms) "
"ኖዶች ነቅቷል።"

msgid ""
"If checked, form sharing will be enabled for webform nodes that use "
"this webform."
msgstr ""
"ከተመረጠ፣ ይህን ዌብፎርም የሚጠቀሙ "
"ዌብፎርም ኖዶች ለድር ቅጾች መጋራት "
"ይነቃል።"

msgid "Display title on shared form"
msgstr "በተጋራ ፎርም ላይ  శይትል አሳይ"

msgid "If checked, the page title will displayed on this shared webform."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ከተመረጠ (checked) የገጹ ርዕስ በዚህ "
"በተጋራ የድር ቅጽ (shared webform) ላይ ይታያል።"

msgid "Select the theme that will be used to render this shared webform."
msgstr ""
"මෙ/shared webformን ለመቅረብ የሚጠቅም ገጽታ "
"(theme) ይምረጡ።"

msgid "Page body attributes"
msgstr "د የገጽ አካል ባህሪዎች"

msgid "Form share settings"
msgstr "የፎርም መጋራት ቅንብሮች"

msgid "If checking, form sharing will be enabled for all webforms."
msgstr ""
"እንደሚፈትሽ ከሆነ፣ ቅጾችን መጋራት "
"ለሁሉም ድር ቅጾች (webforms) ይነቃል።"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Share embed</strong> page provides code snippets that are "
"used to embedded a webform in any website, webpage, and application."
msgstr ""
"የ<strong>Embed ማጋራት</strong> ገጹ የድረ-ገጽ ቅጽ "
"(webform) በማንኛውም ድር ጣቢያ፣ ድር ገጽ እና "
"መተግበሪያ ውስጥ ለማስገባት (embed) "
"የሚያገለግሉ የኮድ ናሙናዎችን ያቀርባል።"

