"You may not delete %title webform until you have removed all of the "
"%title submissions."
msgstr ""
"ሁሉንም %title  സമዝጊዎች ከመሰረዝ በኋላ "
"ካልተወገዱ በስተቀር %title webform መሰረዝ "
"አይችሉም።"

msgid ""
"Please make sure to install additional <a "
"href=\":libraries_href\">third-party libraries</a>, <a "
"href=\":submodules_href\">sub-modules</a> and optional <a "
"href=\":ecosystem_href\">add-ons</a>."
msgstr ""
"እባክዎ ተጨማሪ <a href=\":libraries_href\">የሦስተኛ "
"ወገን ላይብረሪዎች</a>፣ <a "
"href=\":submodules_href\">ንዑስ-ሞጁሎች</a> እና "
"አማራጭ <a href=\":ecosystem_href\">ተጨማሪ "
"ቅጥያዎች</a> መጫንዎን ያረጋግጡ።"

msgid "File upload limit per form message"
msgstr ""
"በፎርሙ እያንዳንዱ ለፋይል ማዕቀብ የመጫን "
"ገደብ መልዕክት"

