"የማረጋገጫ መልዕክት፦ የርቀት HTTP ክዋኔ፦ "
"@title [@state]"

msgid "Remote HTTP Operations"
msgstr "ርቀት የHTTP ኦፕሬሽኖች"

msgid ""
"Execute HTTP operation <small>(GET, POST, PUT, or PATCH request "
"methods)</small> to a URL, (optionally) including the webform "
"submissions."
msgstr ""
"URL ላይ የ HTTP ኦፕሬሽን አከናውን <small>(GET፣ "
"POST፣ PUT ወይም PATCH የጥያቄ ዘዴዎች)</small> "
"በመጠቀም፣ (አማራጭ) የዌብፎርም "
"ምዝገባዎችን ጨምሮ።"

